WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:09.625
If every dealer gave as much as you,

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.791
the world would become Caesar's slave.

00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:15.208
- I have a plan to turn that into reality.
- What's that?

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.791
There's this guy named Vincent in Chennai.

00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:23.291
He runs an illegal gambling club
in the basement of his theater.

00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:44.208
Vincent is a childhood friend of mine.

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:47.708
- The other day at his club…
- Hey, Ezhil.

00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:49.541
How are you?

00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:50.875
All good.

00:02:52.166 --> 00:02:54.666
If you let someone stay sober in a club,

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.500
he'd keep winning all the time.

00:02:59.416 --> 00:03:00.791
But if you kept him intoxicated,

00:03:01.416 --> 00:03:02.750
you can keep winning.

00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:09.666
Good stuff.

00:03:10.208 --> 00:03:12.041
- Caesar.
- What's in it for you?

00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:15.041
I'm the sole dealer
for this stuff in Tamil Nadu.

00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:18.333
If we can use your club
as a hub to peddle this

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.750
we can split the profit fifty-fifty.

00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:24.625
All the profits you make at the club
are yours.

00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:26.208
What do you say?

00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:31.541
I brainwashed him and turned
his club into our hub.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.333
By pressing this device,
the game stays in our control.

00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:56.083
So, we can fix every game.

00:04:02.416 --> 00:04:05.291
Gambling and intoxication
are like two faces of a coin.

00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:08.333
By getting people hooked to it,
you can earn millions.

00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:09.791
To get there, all we need to do is

00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:13.833
to start many clubs
just like Vincent's.

00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:15.625
Traitor.

00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:19.541
He started this business
because he trusted you.

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:23.208
And you're here making a deal with me
after you shot these videos in secret.

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:30.083
I can only be loyal to one person.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.708
My loyalty is to you, Reddy <i>garu.</i>

00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:46.250
Get started with your plan.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:50.625
This is the key
to my locker that's overseas.

00:04:56.458 --> 00:05:02.166
Take how much ever money you need
after informing me.

00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:14.166
Use this as an investment
for the business we're about to begin.

00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:16.083
See you soon, Reddy <i>garu.</i>

00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:16.291
INDHRA LIBRARY

00:06:20.708 --> 00:06:24.416
<i>This is the story of a guy</i>
<i>Who was never lucky</i>

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:28.041
<i>God, just show him a little mercy</i>

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:30.208
<i>God, just show him a little mercy</i>

00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:43.125
<i>- Not every smart man gets ahead</i>
- Lucky, here you go!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.833
<i>- And not everyone who wins is smart</i>
- Go ahead, eat it!

00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:49.083
<i>Not necessarily</i>

00:06:57.958 --> 00:07:01.708
<i>You flip the switch,</i>
<i>The light comes on</i>

00:07:01.791 --> 00:07:05.708
<i>With my luck,</i>
<i>The light switches me off</i>

00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:09.166
<i>The moment I started betting,</i>
<i>They banned it</i>

00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:13.000
<i>Then came the stock market</i>
<i>And it wrecked me</i>

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.916
<i>I try to stay strong,</i>
<i>And life piles on more</i>

00:07:17.041 --> 00:07:20.875
{\an8}<i>Life is a circle,</i>
<i>Mine is a blooper reel</i>

00:07:22.625 --> 00:07:26.291
{\an8}<i>Not every smart man gets ahead</i>

00:07:26.416 --> 00:07:30.041
<i>And not everyone who wins is smart</i>

00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:32.083
{\an8}<i>Not necessarily</i>

00:07:52.416 --> 00:07:56.041
<i>Don't wait for luck to save you</i>

00:07:56.125 --> 00:08:00.000
<i>I step into the chaos</i>
<i>And play my part</i>

00:08:00.166 --> 00:08:03.541
<i>You can't stay lucky forever</i>

00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:07.541
<i>I earn every bite the hard way</i>

00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:11.291
{\an8}<i>However hard I fall,</i>
<i>I keep getting up</i>

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:15.541
{\an8}<i>I may mess up the league,</i>
<i>But I'll win the finals</i>

00:08:17.166 --> 00:08:19.708
We've been looking for him
ever since I became a DGP.

00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:21.958
They finally got rid of him.

00:08:24.458 --> 00:08:25.333
What's wrong, Guru?

00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:27.458
Why are you upset?

00:08:27.708 --> 00:08:31.333
What else, sir? The interest on my debt
keeps going up.

00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:33.916
Nobody comes to the library
these days, sir.

00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:37.833
I'm scared I can't repay
my debt with this.

00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:41.458
Kids these days don't read books
to gain knowledge.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.166
They choose the internet for that.

00:08:44.833 --> 00:08:49.000
The joy and wisdom in books
can't be found elsewhere.

00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:51.208
Don't worry. Everything will be alright.

00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:03.791
<i>Keep standing there quietly</i>
<i>And trouble will find you</i>

00:09:03.875 --> 00:09:07.541
<i>Fight back,</i>
<i>And they will back off</i>

00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:11.291
<i>Be patient,</i>
<i>And your day will come</i>

00:09:11.416 --> 00:09:14.875
<i>Stand up and make yourself heard</i>

00:09:15.083 --> 00:09:18.708
<i>Love doesn't make you weak</i>

00:09:18.791 --> 00:09:22.791
<i>A real fighter gets back up</i>

00:09:22.875 --> 00:09:24.041
AUDIO LIBRARY

00:09:24.291 --> 00:09:26.583
HEY, MAN.
SPEAK ONLY IF YOU KNOW HOW TO TALK

00:09:35.791 --> 00:09:39.291
<i>Not every smart man gets ahead</i>

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.125
<i>And not everyone who wins is smart</i>

00:09:43.208 --> 00:09:46.833
<i>Not every smart man gets ahead</i>

00:09:46.958 --> 00:09:50.666
<i>And not everyone who wins is smart</i>

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.708
<i>Not necessarily</i>

00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:20.375
Brother.

00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:23.791
No need to be violent.
I was about to meet you tomorrow.

00:10:24.666 --> 00:10:26.083
- Dear!
- Brother…

00:10:26.666 --> 00:10:27.541
What?

00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:30.583
Don't kill him by accident, dear.

00:10:30.791 --> 00:10:32.625
Who'll repay the money he borrowed?

00:10:33.375 --> 00:10:35.125
- Let go, brother.
- Let him go, dear.

00:10:38.875 --> 00:10:40.708
When will you return
the 1.25 crores you owe us?

00:10:41.041 --> 00:10:43.416
You said one crore last week, sister.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.958
Huh? This isn't some loan
you took out yesterday.

00:10:47.166 --> 00:10:50.541
This is a twenty-year-old loan that your
father took from his father.

00:10:50.875 --> 00:10:54.583
It's 1.25 crores now because
of interest and the interest on interest.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:55.875
When will you pay up?

00:10:56.250 --> 00:11:00.125
Even if we sold this library,
we wouldn't get a dime over 70 lakhs.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:01.750
That's why we haven't sold this place.

00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:03.833
I'll pay you back, sister.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.666
Here you go again.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:07.625
How long will this go on?

00:11:08.166 --> 00:11:10.208
Have you no shame?

00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:14.125
Sister.

00:11:15.333 --> 00:11:17.125
- Scold me again.
- Huh?

00:11:18.583 --> 00:11:19.750
Sister. Scold me.

00:11:20.916 --> 00:11:22.708
Why are you torturing me?

00:11:22.833 --> 00:11:24.541
- Don't you want the money?
- I do.

00:11:24.791 --> 00:11:25.791
Scold me then.

00:11:26.541 --> 00:11:27.583
Please. Please scold me.

00:11:28.041 --> 00:11:29.291
You!

00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:34.541
Have you no shame or self-respect?

00:11:34.625 --> 00:11:35.541
Yes!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.750
- What a wow!
- What are you saying?

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.125
I run an audio book channel, sister.

00:11:41.208 --> 00:11:44.083
- I've been searching for a female voice.
- Okay.

00:11:44.166 --> 00:11:46.291
If your voice becomes a hit online…

00:11:46.375 --> 00:11:47.500
No, when it becomes a hit.

00:11:48.875 --> 00:11:50.375
- Just a minute, brother.
- Dear.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.166
I can pay back the money I owe you.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:57.583
Besides that, I'll pay you a salary
for voicing the videos.

00:11:58.083 --> 00:11:59.333
- Hey.
- Sister?

00:11:59.458 --> 00:12:00.833
Is he making sense?

00:12:01.208 --> 00:12:03.625
Sister, when something
becomes a hit online

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:04.833
you can mint money from it!

00:12:04.916 --> 00:12:07.333
Even I've earned a lot
from uploading stuff online.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:08.500
Huh?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.416
Kunjumani is usually right
about these things.

00:12:13.583 --> 00:12:15.125
I should just listen to him.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.583
Wait, sister. I'll bring my equipment.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.416
Wait.

00:12:22.791 --> 00:12:24.541
Let's see what he does. Wait.

00:12:26.333 --> 00:12:27.416
All ready, sister.

00:12:27.666 --> 00:12:28.666
Mm.

00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:33.666
As far as the townsfolk were concerned,
Matta Sekar was a gangster.

00:12:33.833 --> 00:12:36.750
But only his wife, Lakshmi, knew

00:12:36.833 --> 00:12:38.583
Sekar was a grown-up infant.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.166
Honey, it sounds just like our story.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.541
Lakshmi took good care of her husband.

00:12:46.791 --> 00:12:50.541
Even Matta Sekar's disciples loved him.

00:12:50.708 --> 00:12:52.750
They lived just like a family.

00:12:55.541 --> 00:12:58.666
Then came his final disciple.

00:12:59.375 --> 00:13:00.333
Kutty Mani.

00:13:00.541 --> 00:13:04.291
He became a part of the family
very quickly.

00:13:06.166 --> 00:13:08.291
- Everything's going well, sister.
- Okay.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.833
Let's just dial in the highs and lows.

00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:13.250
- I'll read it out once.
- Okay.

00:13:13.708 --> 00:13:17.500
Even though Matta Sekar was buffed up,
he was a child at heart.

00:13:19.041 --> 00:13:25.208
Maybe because of this, Lakshmi's gaze
turned to Kutty Mani.

00:13:25.333 --> 00:13:26.416
<i>Uh-oh.</i>

00:13:27.416 --> 00:13:32.166
Lakshmi's heart fell for
Kutty Mani's poetry

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.291
and fell for him one day.

00:13:35.625 --> 00:13:37.250
<i>Fell for him?</i>

00:13:40.333 --> 00:13:43.333
Brother! All that
hasn't happened yet.

00:13:43.416 --> 00:13:46.000
Please! Trust me, brother. Sister!

00:13:48.916 --> 00:13:50.208
Brother, what did I do?

00:13:50.708 --> 00:13:53.541
Hey! Are you making fun of me and my wife?

00:13:53.625 --> 00:13:55.333
My wife is a symbol of virtue!

00:13:57.541 --> 00:14:01.416
You think you can fool me
like you fooled my father?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:05.625
Look, this is your last chance.
Cough up the money!

00:14:07.083 --> 00:14:09.750
I said whatever you wanted to say, dear.

00:14:09.875 --> 00:14:12.666
Let's go. Don't get angry.
Come on, let's go.

00:14:13.375 --> 00:14:15.833
Let's get going.
Let's talk it out, whatever it is.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.625
I just want to know what happens next.

00:14:26.208 --> 00:14:27.333
- I'll knock you out.
- Sister!

00:14:34.208 --> 00:14:36.708
<i>Like picking a thorn with thorn</i>

00:14:37.041 --> 00:14:39.125
<i>Let's fight fire with fire</i>

00:14:39.208 --> 00:14:45.458
<i>Long live the fire of love</i>
<i>That lives in your eyes</i>

00:14:45.583 --> 00:14:46.625
<i>Oh no, it's caught fire!</i>

00:14:48.958 --> 00:14:51.416
The solution to your problem is with you.

00:14:51.708 --> 00:14:55.125
Sell that place. Settle your debt.
Live in peace.

00:14:55.666 --> 00:14:57.083
Is that just a library, Doctor?

00:14:58.041 --> 00:14:59.875
How could you say that
despite knowing everything?

00:14:59.958 --> 00:15:02.000
- Thank you so much.
- Thank you.

00:15:02.083 --> 00:15:03.583
I understand your dilemma.

00:15:04.625 --> 00:15:06.583
Did your YouTube channel not take off?

00:15:06.916 --> 00:15:09.250
I've created so many fake accounts,

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.333
liked, and subscribed to your channel.

00:15:11.583 --> 00:15:13.708
- Even that didn't work, huh?
- Hey!

00:15:14.083 --> 00:15:15.166
So that was you?

00:15:15.583 --> 00:15:19.375
When I read the names they sounded
like a boomer made them.

00:15:20.041 --> 00:15:21.291
I didn't realize it was you though.

00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:23.458
Everyone sounds depraved on there.

00:15:24.208 --> 00:15:25.708
They want a female voice, it seems.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.416
Why do I need a female voice
to narrate my kind of content, Doctor?

00:15:29.583 --> 00:15:31.708
Give the audience what they want.

00:15:31.875 --> 00:15:34.833
- You want to find a voice? Let's find it.
- Okay!

00:15:34.916 --> 00:15:36.500
Who's ready to sing next?

00:15:36.833 --> 00:15:37.708
- Anyone?
- Here.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.125
She'll sing.

00:15:39.208 --> 00:15:40.291
- Hey! Why are you…
- Wow!

00:15:40.375 --> 00:15:42.208
- We've got RJ Sam in the house.
- Go, go and sing.

00:15:42.333 --> 00:15:43.250
Please welcome her.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.375
- Go ahead.
- Come on.

00:15:46.666 --> 00:15:50.416
<i>His million stories mad me melt</i>

00:15:50.833 --> 00:15:53.833
<i>His love hit me like waves</i>

00:15:53.916 --> 00:15:55.166
- Guru--
- Shh.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.875
<i>How did he change overnight?</i>

00:15:59.208 --> 00:16:03.208
<i>His lightning gaze is killing me</i>

00:16:03.666 --> 00:16:07.625
<i>The love he gives makes me rise</i>

00:16:07.875 --> 00:16:11.916
<i>Is that all the sweetness he can show?</i>

00:16:19.708 --> 00:16:21.541
Thank you. That'll be all. That'll be all.

00:16:22.333 --> 00:16:23.208
Thank you.

00:16:31.291 --> 00:16:32.708
- Beer.
- Yes, sir.

00:16:33.916 --> 00:16:35.583
The beauty of a voice

00:16:36.125 --> 00:16:37.500
always makes a noise.

00:16:38.083 --> 00:16:38.958
J.K. Rowling?

00:16:39.041 --> 00:16:40.041
Harry Potter, the third book?

00:16:40.625 --> 00:16:41.583
Haven't you read it?

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.541
People who talk on the radio
all morning…

00:16:46.833 --> 00:16:47.791
RJ.

00:16:48.125 --> 00:16:49.375
Aren't you RJ Sam?

00:16:51.125 --> 00:16:53.208
- You have a bright future.
- Is that so?

00:16:53.291 --> 00:16:54.208
Yeah.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:59.166
How's it like being an RJ?

00:16:59.958 --> 00:17:00.958
Uh…

00:17:01.041 --> 00:17:02.625
Do you work mornings daily or

00:17:02.916 --> 00:17:04.208
- afternoons--
- Could you please make it fast?

00:17:04.291 --> 00:17:05.291
Yes, ma'am.

00:17:05.916 --> 00:17:07.958
Can't a girl sit all by herself
for a while?

00:17:08.625 --> 00:17:12.166
Do you guys prowl pubs
looking for girls to flirt with?

00:17:13.458 --> 00:17:15.166
Why would you worry about that?

00:17:15.458 --> 00:17:17.000
I only said your voice sounds good.

00:17:18.125 --> 00:17:19.958
I'm running an audio book channel.

00:17:20.916 --> 00:17:24.041
I felt having a female voice
would make the channel better.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.041
- It's not what you think.
- Oh.

00:17:26.125 --> 00:17:27.833
What kind of a channel is that, sir?

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.500
{\an8}<i>Oli Noolagam.</i>
It's doing well.

00:17:31.208 --> 00:17:33.666
I just thought a female touch
would make it better.

00:17:34.375 --> 00:17:36.916
It would be a great option for you.
Think about it.

00:17:39.375 --> 00:17:41.500
Just 110 subscribers.

00:17:41.583 --> 00:17:42.791
Is this supposed to be a channel?

00:17:43.708 --> 00:17:44.958
Uh, look.

00:17:45.208 --> 00:17:47.250
Before you approach someone next time

00:17:47.541 --> 00:17:50.708
find someone who's fit for this channel.

00:17:54.125 --> 00:17:55.708
Have a good night. Thanks.

00:17:59.208 --> 00:18:02.625
Hello, listeners.
Welcome back to Coffee with Sam.

00:18:02.958 --> 00:18:04.916
Now, let's go to the next caller.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.375
- Hello.
<i>- Hi, Sam!</i>

00:18:06.666 --> 00:18:08.250
<i>This is Williams from Saligramam.</i>

00:18:08.916 --> 00:18:12.000
<i>- Hello?</i>
- Tell me, Williams. What's your question?

00:18:12.333 --> 00:18:17.416
<i>You give ideas to help lovers and friends</i>
<i>and lecture on about loving parents.</i>

00:18:17.583 --> 00:18:19.333
<i>So, tell us. When do you plan</i>
<i>to get married?</i>

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.125
<i>Is it a love marriage?</i>
<i>Or is it arranged marriage?</i>

00:18:21.791 --> 00:18:25.208
- I'm not in love, Williams.
<i>- Oh, no. Tsk, tsk.</i>

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.083
I'm not interested in getting married.

00:18:27.333 --> 00:18:30.000
<i>Why, Sam? Aren't some things</i>
<i>supposed to happen on time?</i>

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:32.708
<i>Why don't you get married for the sake of</i>
<i>your dad, at least?</i>

00:18:33.125 --> 00:18:34.041
<i>He's a poor man, isn't he?</i>

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.458
- I'll consider it, Williams sir.
<i>- Very good!</i>

00:18:38.541 --> 00:18:40.500
What song would you like me to play now?

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:47.000
<i>Who's the guy? Who could he be?</i>
<i>Your future groom-to-be!</i>

00:18:47.333 --> 00:18:50.291
<i>Play that song. I dedicate it to you.</i>

00:18:50.458 --> 00:18:52.708
Okay. Thank you for your call.

00:18:54.375 --> 00:18:56.500
Everything in here
has a history behind it.

00:18:56.583 --> 00:18:59.166
Right from the remains
of the Pallavaram market… Sorry.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:03.333
From the sword used by Pallava kings
to the scale used by the Britishers.

00:19:03.458 --> 00:19:04.708
This gramophone has one too.

00:19:05.125 --> 00:19:09.958
A Governor-general named Thomas brought it
from England to gift it to his lover.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.541
It's all redwood.
It would cost just 8,000 rupees.

00:19:13.333 --> 00:19:14.333
Just a moment.

00:19:15.916 --> 00:19:17.375
Are you planning to buy something?

00:19:18.666 --> 00:19:19.583
Get going then.

00:19:19.833 --> 00:19:20.833
- Sam!
- Come on. Let's go.

00:19:20.916 --> 00:19:22.708
- It's a rare piece, sir. Please, sir.
- No, no. We don't want.

00:19:22.791 --> 00:19:23.958
You won't find this
even at Pallavaram, sir.

00:19:24.458 --> 00:19:27.791
I've never seen you sell anything
from your shop once in my life.

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:31.208
Even if someone turns up to the shop

00:19:31.458 --> 00:19:36.708
you refuse to sell it to them, claiming
it's ancient and extraordinarily rare.

00:19:37.583 --> 00:19:41.208
Listen. We'll talk about my wedding

00:19:41.625 --> 00:19:44.250
when I become financially independent.
Got it?

00:19:47.291 --> 00:19:48.208
Go, now.

00:19:57.291 --> 00:20:00.416
Agathian, who appeared unassuming to the
eyes of his female friends,

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:03.708
appeared handsome to Veni's eyes.

00:20:05.333 --> 00:20:08.500
<i>Agathian, who appeared unassuming to the</i>
<i>eyes of his female friends,</i>

00:20:08.666 --> 00:20:11.583
<i>appeared handsome to Veni's eyes.</i>

00:20:15.375 --> 00:20:17.291
- Why are you doing this?
- Quiet. Come on.

00:20:17.375 --> 00:20:20.125
So why do people call you
<i>Kavithai</i> Ganesh?

00:20:25.041 --> 00:20:25.958
Oh, that?

00:20:27.583 --> 00:20:28.875
By turning the alphabets to seeds

00:20:29.375 --> 00:20:30.666
and words to fertilizer,

00:20:31.083 --> 00:20:32.250
I grew a tree called poetry.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.958
Only now has the tree

00:20:35.333 --> 00:20:37.333
began to blossom into flowers of love.

00:20:37.458 --> 00:20:40.000
Flowers of love?
I don't understand.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.333
You shouldn't. That's poetry.

00:20:43.416 --> 00:20:45.083
<i>Kavithai</i> Ganesh alias K.G.

00:20:46.125 --> 00:20:49.583
<i>His physique bothered her youth.</i>

00:20:50.375 --> 00:20:53.375
Rain. Chilli <i>Bajji.</i> Tea.
I love these. What about you?

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.541
A little dope

00:20:55.833 --> 00:20:58.833
and a chick by my side is something
I really love. Come on.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.958
You couldn't find a better place?

00:21:10.666 --> 00:21:12.333
The most comfortable place.

00:21:14.708 --> 00:21:16.791
For someone who hated love all these days,

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.541
she instantly fell for his eyes.

00:21:19.708 --> 00:21:22.125
<i>I'm the king of action</i>

00:21:22.416 --> 00:21:24.250
<i>KG, KG, KG</i>

00:21:24.416 --> 00:21:25.708
<i>Hey, what are you doing?</i>

00:21:30.916 --> 00:21:32.416
Aren't old cars the best?

00:21:32.541 --> 00:21:33.791
- Hey!
- Very spacious.

00:21:34.333 --> 00:21:35.958
Hey. Who are you?

00:21:36.041 --> 00:21:36.916
Hey! Come out!

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.291
- Come out, I said. Who are you?
- Sir. Five minutes, sir! Please.

00:21:39.666 --> 00:21:41.833
Who are you?
What are you doing in my grandpa's car?

00:21:41.916 --> 00:21:43.875
- Who are you?
- Sir! Sir! It's my brother, sir.

00:21:43.958 --> 00:21:46.125
- What are you guys doing in the car?
- Hey, Myna! Hey!

00:21:46.208 --> 00:21:48.250
- He got stuck perfectly.
- These guys!

00:21:48.375 --> 00:21:50.416
I've been looking for you all along.

00:21:50.708 --> 00:21:52.416
You couldn't find a better place
than my grandpa's car to do your deed?

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:53.625
Let go. It's an old car!

00:21:53.875 --> 00:21:56.041
Do you know how difficult it is to find
herb and a girl these days?

00:21:56.125 --> 00:21:57.125
You ruined a golden chance.

00:21:57.208 --> 00:21:58.458
You sobered me up and ruined my night!

00:21:58.541 --> 00:21:59.416
You…

00:22:00.958 --> 00:22:02.000
After what you did…

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:03.625
Grandpa.

00:22:05.708 --> 00:22:07.458
Hey. Get up.

00:22:09.208 --> 00:22:11.500
Hey. Stop acting. Get up.

00:22:11.583 --> 00:22:13.666
Hey! Stop acting. Get up!

00:22:16.416 --> 00:22:17.708
Hey! Stop acting.

00:22:18.291 --> 00:22:19.166
Hey!

00:23:22.583 --> 00:23:23.458
Myna!

00:23:25.625 --> 00:23:26.583
Myna!

00:23:27.833 --> 00:23:29.166
- Hey!
- Hey!

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:31.250
Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:23:31.666 --> 00:23:33.875
- I won't leave you!
- I'll save you.

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:03.625
Good heavens. He would've buried you.
You woke up before that.

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:09.541
Hey! Stop touching me.

00:24:11.500 --> 00:24:12.833
You don't look like a doctor to me.

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:15.333
Do you plan to steal and sell my organs?

00:24:16.083 --> 00:24:17.833
Guru, should he live?

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:19.458
You could've buried him.

00:24:20.791 --> 00:24:21.875
Shall I go to the police?

00:24:24.291 --> 00:24:25.583
If you don't want me to go to the police,

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:26.875
you must do something.

00:24:27.791 --> 00:24:29.291
Two thousand rupees for bashing me.

00:24:29.583 --> 00:24:31.250
Three thousand for ruining my night.

00:24:31.333 --> 00:24:34.500
Round it up to ten thousand
and I'll keep quiet.

00:24:35.041 --> 00:24:36.708
- Sounds pretty cheap.
- Son-in-law?

00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:38.916
Uh-oh. It's my mother-in-law!

00:24:39.416 --> 00:24:40.375
What happened?

00:24:41.208 --> 00:24:43.583
- Uh. It's nothing. I was asleep.
- It's nothing. It's nothing.

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:46.833
This intoxicated body was lying on the
road, pretty beat up.

00:24:46.958 --> 00:24:48.833
Sir brought in this body for treatment.

00:24:48.916 --> 00:24:50.625
- What? Body?!
- That's right. Ask him.

00:24:50.708 --> 00:24:52.125
This body is alive.

00:24:52.375 --> 00:24:54.708
That's because he has me as his doctor
by his side.

00:24:54.958 --> 00:24:56.333
You don't have to worry about anything.

00:24:56.416 --> 00:24:57.916
<i>Wasn't she there last night?</i>

00:24:59.041 --> 00:25:00.916
<i>No, buddy.</i>

00:25:01.333 --> 00:25:03.166
You're a weakling, aren't you?

00:25:03.291 --> 00:25:04.583
Why did you go out all alone?

00:25:04.916 --> 00:25:08.000
- Not really, Aunty.
- Why don't you take my daughter along?

00:25:08.083 --> 00:25:10.541
- Yes, Aunty.
- You never listen to us.

00:25:10.625 --> 00:25:13.041
- Keep quiet, Mom.
- You're spoiling him!

00:25:13.125 --> 00:25:14.416
Why are you yapping on?

00:25:14.791 --> 00:25:17.041
This body… Sorry, this patient
needs to rest.

00:25:17.125 --> 00:25:18.541
Step outside. Come on.

00:25:18.875 --> 00:25:20.458
- Some doctor.
- Dear.

00:25:20.541 --> 00:25:21.500
In love, huh?

00:25:22.125 --> 00:25:24.541
Feelings? Step this way. Come on.

00:25:24.791 --> 00:25:27.083
Aunty, why don't you
get a full-body checkup?

00:25:30.958 --> 00:25:32.708
Looks like there are many lives
dependent on you.

00:25:33.583 --> 00:25:35.083
Yes, bro. Please. Don't tell anyone.

00:25:35.250 --> 00:25:36.250
Please, bro.

00:25:36.333 --> 00:25:38.083
Wife packs a mean punch, huh?

00:25:38.250 --> 00:25:39.750
My wife doesn't.

00:25:40.333 --> 00:25:41.458
But my mother-in-law does.

00:25:41.625 --> 00:25:43.875
She's a terror. It really hurts!
Please, bro.

00:25:44.083 --> 00:25:45.083
Let's make a deal.

00:25:46.000 --> 00:25:47.166
I'll forget what happened yesterday

00:25:47.291 --> 00:25:49.041
and so will you. Deal?

00:25:51.041 --> 00:25:52.041
Bro?

00:25:52.500 --> 00:25:53.500
Keep this, bro.

00:25:54.291 --> 00:25:55.916
- You!
- You said we had a deal.

00:25:56.875 --> 00:25:58.791
- Can't say no when money comes my way.
- Yes, bro.

00:25:59.375 --> 00:26:00.875
<i>Why's he sentimental about it?</i>

00:26:04.291 --> 00:26:05.291
50 RUPEES

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:09.916
Haven't seen a fifty rupee note before?

00:26:11.041 --> 00:26:12.208
I've seen money before.

00:26:13.541 --> 00:26:16.875
But this is the first time I've realized
how to turn truth into money.

00:26:23.583 --> 00:26:25.541
Lucky, what are you doing?

00:26:26.458 --> 00:26:27.458
Eat up.

00:26:28.416 --> 00:26:29.916
Eat it, come on.

00:26:31.000 --> 00:26:34.833
You're always gnawing on
something or the other. Give it.

00:26:35.208 --> 00:26:36.083
Give it.

00:26:48.333 --> 00:26:49.375
Come here.

00:26:49.625 --> 00:26:51.083
Eat up. Go on.

00:26:58.541 --> 00:27:00.708
<i>For someone who had shunned love</i>
<i>all along,</i>

00:27:01.125 --> 00:27:03.416
<i>fell for his eyes instantly.</i>

00:27:04.250 --> 00:27:08.500
<i>Her heart began to sing his praises.</i>

00:27:10.125 --> 00:27:13.791
She was acting as if she had
Shreya Ghoshal's voice, Doctor.

00:27:13.875 --> 00:27:16.166
<i>- Yes.</i>
- I just uploaded her voice sample to AI.

00:27:16.291 --> 00:27:17.750
<i>- Okay, okay.</i>
- After messing around with a few settings

00:27:18.000 --> 00:27:20.041
it fit with minor changes.

00:27:20.125 --> 00:27:21.708
<i>- You're pretty smart.</i>
- The views are just exploding.

00:27:21.916 --> 00:27:24.541
- That video pulls views to others.
<i>- Oh!</i>

00:27:24.625 --> 00:27:26.083
I can continue to earn some money.

00:27:26.166 --> 00:27:29.333
Who gives a damn if she doesn't
do voice overs…

00:27:29.416 --> 00:27:31.166
<i>Why are you dragging on?</i>

00:27:31.250 --> 00:27:32.125
- Sir.
<i>- Sir?!</i>

00:27:32.208 --> 00:27:33.916
- Yes, sir. I'm at the library.
<i>- I know that.</i>

00:27:34.000 --> 00:27:35.541
- You can find any book you want, sir.
<i>- Hey.</i>

00:27:35.625 --> 00:27:37.083
Sorry, we have a new customer here.

00:27:37.166 --> 00:27:38.166
<i>A customer when you're around?</i>

00:27:38.250 --> 00:27:39.791
- Bye, sir. Take care.
<i>- Hey! Hey!</i>

00:27:42.833 --> 00:27:45.041
Who gave you the permission
to use my voice?

00:27:45.208 --> 00:27:47.291
- You call that a channel?
- Don't you dare hit me!

00:27:47.375 --> 00:27:48.916
- And you want to use my voice?
- Hey!

00:27:49.125 --> 00:27:50.125
What?

00:27:50.458 --> 00:27:51.458
That was before.

00:27:52.041 --> 00:27:53.750
Do you know about <i>Oli Noolagam</i> now?

00:27:54.083 --> 00:27:55.625
The views are going through the roof.

00:27:55.708 --> 00:27:58.208
- The subscribers count will shoot up too.
- Is it?

00:27:58.333 --> 00:27:59.458
That's because of my voice.

00:27:59.541 --> 00:28:01.083
You still believe that, huh?

00:28:01.375 --> 00:28:02.791
Saw what I just did?

00:28:03.125 --> 00:28:06.708
I uploaded a sample of your voice on AI
and tweaked it a bit.

00:28:06.875 --> 00:28:09.125
That was all. It worked so well.

00:28:09.375 --> 00:28:11.208
If you want, I can make a fair deal.

00:28:12.166 --> 00:28:13.750
I'm using AI now, right?

00:28:14.000 --> 00:28:15.500
Why don't you do that instead?

00:28:15.708 --> 00:28:19.041
I can give you a small cut
of the huge profits I make.

00:28:19.541 --> 00:28:20.500
Huh?

00:28:20.958 --> 00:28:22.083
How about eighty-twenty?

00:28:22.291 --> 00:28:24.375
- Eighty-twenty?!
- Ouch.

00:28:25.416 --> 00:28:26.875
Why don't you make a better deal?

00:28:27.416 --> 00:28:28.333
Sixty-forty.

00:28:28.791 --> 00:28:30.416
- You!
- Hey! Okay. Okay.

00:28:30.500 --> 00:28:33.208
Hey! That's iron. If you hit me with that
you'll face a murder case.

00:28:33.541 --> 00:28:37.250
- Hey!
- Hey, Lucky. It's nothing. Hey!

00:28:37.958 --> 00:28:39.125
Hey, come here.

00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:42.833
- Ask that to leave.
- Why are you afraid of her?

00:28:43.083 --> 00:28:44.958
She's just a kid. She won't harm you.

00:28:45.083 --> 00:28:46.250
Okay. To be fair,

00:28:46.833 --> 00:28:47.791
as partners,

00:28:48.458 --> 00:28:49.416
Fifty-fifty.

00:28:53.875 --> 00:28:54.750
Fine.

00:29:02.291 --> 00:29:03.541
Did I overreact?

00:29:15.875 --> 00:29:16.875
Woah!

00:29:25.041 --> 00:29:26.125
SOUND LIBRARY

00:29:36.583 --> 00:29:37.458
THE WAYS AND PATTERNS
OF WRITING LETTERS

00:29:39.208 --> 00:29:40.083
INTIMATE SECRETS

00:29:58.833 --> 00:29:59.875
THIS SOUNDS LIKE RJ SAM'S VOICE

00:30:02.666 --> 00:30:06.416
<i>You're my heart's delight,</i>
<i>The one who stole my soul</i>

00:30:06.541 --> 00:30:10.041
<i>You're like gentle rain</i>
<i>From the clouds above</i>

00:30:10.375 --> 00:30:14.208
<i>I'll lead the way,</i>
<i>You're my hope</i>

00:30:14.375 --> 00:30:17.958
<i>The day you looked at me,</i>
<i>My heart lit up</i>

00:30:18.541 --> 00:30:22.166
<i>Out of the blue,</i>
<i>You took my breath away</i>

00:30:22.541 --> 00:30:26.083
<i>With just one glance,</i>
<i>I lost myself</i>

00:30:26.416 --> 00:30:30.041
<i>Take my hand and</i>
<i>Hold on tight</i>

00:30:30.250 --> 00:30:33.791
<i>Where else could I</i>
<i>Find love so bright?</i>

00:30:33.875 --> 00:30:37.708
<i>A fragrance fills the air,</i>
<i>The skies have changed</i>

00:30:37.791 --> 00:30:40.625
<i>She came along</i>
<i>To walk by my side</i>

00:30:40.708 --> 00:30:43.583
<i>I tremble, as the breeze turns warm</i>

00:30:43.666 --> 00:30:48.458
<i>Pain turns to bloom,</i>
<i>She makes every day worth living!</i>

00:30:49.833 --> 00:30:53.500
<i>Oh my heart,</i>
<i>I'm lost and shaken</i>

00:30:53.708 --> 00:30:57.083
<i>I stood my ground,</i>
<i>But I'm stumbling now</i>

00:30:57.541 --> 00:31:01.208
<i>You're a smiling tease,</i>
<i>A mirror in motion</i>

00:31:01.458 --> 00:31:04.958
<i>I'll fly around you,</i>
<i>What blame is mine?</i>

00:31:40.125 --> 00:31:43.791
<i>He spoke to me like a story,</i>
<i>And left me drowning in it</i>

00:31:44.041 --> 00:31:47.750
<i>He swept through me in waves,</i>
<i>And made me fade away</i>

00:31:47.958 --> 00:31:51.500
<i>Like rain falling softly,</i>
<i>He filled my empty soul</i>

00:31:51.875 --> 00:31:55.583
<i>Even when I tried to resist,</i>
<i>He crossed into my heart</i>

00:31:56.166 --> 00:31:59.750
<i>Out of the blue,</i>
<i>You took my breath away</i>

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:03.541
<i>With just one glance,</i>
<i>I lost myself</i>

00:32:03.666 --> 00:32:07.750
<i>Take my hand,</i>
<i>And hold on tight</i>

00:32:07.833 --> 00:32:11.291
<i>Where else could I</i>
<i>Find love so bright?</i>

00:32:11.375 --> 00:32:15.291
<i>A fragrance fills the air,</i>
<i>The skies have changed</i>

00:32:15.375 --> 00:32:18.208
<i>She came along</i>
<i>To walk by my side</i>

00:32:18.291 --> 00:32:20.625
<i>I tremble,</i>
<i>As the breeze turns warm</i>

00:32:20.708 --> 00:32:27.041
<i>Pain turns to bloom,</i>
<i>She makes every day worth living</i>

00:32:27.291 --> 00:32:30.958
<i>Oh my heart,</i>
<i>I'm lost and shaken</i>

00:32:31.250 --> 00:32:34.708
<i>I stood my ground,</i>
<i>But I'm stumbling now</i>

00:32:35.166 --> 00:32:38.791
<i>You're a smiling tease,</i>
<i>A mirror in motion</i>

00:32:39.083 --> 00:32:42.708
<i>I'll fly around you,</i>
<i>What blame is mine?</i>

00:33:14.416 --> 00:33:15.833
This land belonged to my grandpa.

00:33:16.041 --> 00:33:18.166
- It's the truth!
- Sure. Sure.

00:33:18.791 --> 00:33:20.458
Can't believe he lost everything.

00:33:20.583 --> 00:33:21.916
Hey. Come on.

00:33:22.000 --> 00:33:23.750
I was supposed to be living the high life!

00:33:35.458 --> 00:33:36.458
Hey! Hey!

00:33:37.750 --> 00:33:38.625
Who gave you…

00:33:39.166 --> 00:33:40.125
What are you doing? You!

00:33:40.500 --> 00:33:42.791
- Hey! Let him go! Let him go!
- Unload everything!

00:33:42.958 --> 00:33:44.000
- Let go.
- Hey!

00:33:46.041 --> 00:33:47.791
Sister. What's going on?

00:33:48.291 --> 00:33:49.458
Ask them to unload it, sister.

00:33:50.791 --> 00:33:51.666
Sister?

00:33:52.625 --> 00:33:55.250
You've known me since I was a child.
Won't I pay you back?

00:33:56.000 --> 00:33:58.541
Listen, you're out of time.

00:33:58.875 --> 00:34:00.958
The library belongs to us now.

00:34:19.208 --> 00:34:20.125
Sister.

00:34:20.583 --> 00:34:21.875
Here's two lakh rupees.

00:34:21.958 --> 00:34:24.375
I'll pay you two lakhs every week
till I settle the debt.

00:34:25.083 --> 00:34:26.416
Ask them to stop, sister.

00:34:26.666 --> 00:34:29.541
You try to pay off the interest
in portions, just like this.

00:34:29.625 --> 00:34:30.791
Don't you intend to pay
back the principal?

00:34:30.875 --> 00:34:31.833
Sister!

00:34:32.041 --> 00:34:33.500
This isn't just a library.

00:34:34.833 --> 00:34:37.166
I've always thought that my mother
still lives here.

00:34:37.583 --> 00:34:39.416
What do I do if you take this away,
sister?

00:34:40.666 --> 00:34:41.833
Give me some time, sister.

00:34:42.666 --> 00:34:43.541
Please.

00:34:44.625 --> 00:34:45.583
Look.

00:34:45.916 --> 00:34:47.375
I'll give you a day's time.

00:34:47.625 --> 00:34:51.416
If you can settle your debt by then,
you can keep your place.

00:34:51.875 --> 00:34:53.458
Hey, put everything in!

00:34:55.000 --> 00:34:55.916
Lakshu…

00:34:56.500 --> 00:34:58.458
it's a big deal for him
to come up with any money.

00:34:58.750 --> 00:35:00.541
Why don't you take it
and give him some time?

00:35:02.250 --> 00:35:03.125
Come here.

00:35:03.208 --> 00:35:07.250
They're going to build
a metro station here soon.

00:35:08.125 --> 00:35:11.166
Once that happens, the value
of the land will increase threefold.

00:35:11.250 --> 00:35:12.166
Is it?

00:35:13.083 --> 00:35:16.708
The longer he stays in debt,
the more we benefit.

00:35:16.791 --> 00:35:17.750
Do you understand?

00:35:31.250 --> 00:35:33.208
<i>Enter the Dragon.</i>
Give me one ticket.

00:35:44.750 --> 00:35:46.333
Phone. Money.

00:37:05.833 --> 00:37:07.500
<i>I'll give you a day's time.</i>

00:37:07.583 --> 00:37:11.291
<i>If you can settle your debt by then,</i>
<i>you can keep your place.</i>

00:37:19.250 --> 00:37:20.458
The house wins.

00:38:06.791 --> 00:38:07.666
Hey!

00:38:20.375 --> 00:38:22.500
Sorry, guys. Sorry. Carry on.

00:38:37.750 --> 00:38:38.625
What is it?

00:38:38.875 --> 00:38:40.708
Why are you acting like
you were owed the money?

00:38:41.125 --> 00:38:42.208
It's gambling.

00:38:42.708 --> 00:38:43.666
Gambling?

00:38:44.583 --> 00:38:46.416
Does that mean you can cheat
the players of their money?

00:38:46.666 --> 00:38:48.083
I'm used to losing by now.

00:38:49.750 --> 00:38:51.791
But I've never been fooled before.

00:38:52.625 --> 00:38:53.666
That's my money.

00:38:57.750 --> 00:38:59.083
I let everyone win

00:39:00.791 --> 00:39:02.166
and get to make peanuts?

00:39:03.083 --> 00:39:04.625
The house always wins.

00:39:10.958 --> 00:39:11.958
Get out.

00:39:21.500 --> 00:39:22.500
Hey.

00:39:24.000 --> 00:39:25.083
{\an8}WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
WHY AREN'T YOU ANSWERING YOUR PHONE?

00:39:25.166 --> 00:39:27.375
{\an8}YOU DON'T ANSWER WHEN I CALL
HEY WHERE ARE YOU? PICK UP THE PHONE.

00:39:48.833 --> 00:39:49.708
Sam?

00:40:00.958 --> 00:40:02.041
He'll be okay, Sam.

00:40:03.916 --> 00:40:05.791
I shouldn't have driven like that.

00:40:08.291 --> 00:40:10.041
I was distracted for just a second.

00:40:11.208 --> 00:40:12.625
I should've noticed.

00:40:14.000 --> 00:40:15.000
Why?

00:40:15.583 --> 00:40:17.250
I called you in an emergency

00:40:18.250 --> 00:40:19.250
and you won't answer?

00:40:19.333 --> 00:40:21.125
No, Sam. I didn't have my phone with me.

00:40:23.250 --> 00:40:24.291
At least you're here now.

00:40:24.833 --> 00:40:28.250
Forget it. The bill needs to be paid.
Give me the money.

00:40:29.625 --> 00:40:31.125
Sam… It's…

00:40:32.000 --> 00:40:34.083
- The money…
- I'm asking you.

00:40:35.208 --> 00:40:36.625
The money got spent.

00:40:37.416 --> 00:40:38.666
- Got spent?
- Mm…

00:40:39.041 --> 00:40:40.041
How do I…

00:40:40.708 --> 00:40:42.750
I'm… I don't want your money.

00:40:43.333 --> 00:40:44.666
I'm talking about my money.

00:40:44.833 --> 00:40:46.375
- Sam…
- What happened?

00:40:47.333 --> 00:40:48.833
- I gambled it away, Sam.
- What?!

00:40:49.250 --> 00:40:51.166
I lost it gambling, Sam.

00:40:59.500 --> 00:41:00.791
You weren't cheated.

00:41:01.416 --> 00:41:03.375
I was the one who was cheated
when I trusted you.

00:41:04.083 --> 00:41:06.416
How could you?
Have you no shame?

00:41:07.833 --> 00:41:09.791
Who are you to spend my money man?

00:41:10.708 --> 00:41:12.166
You'll never…

00:41:13.291 --> 00:41:14.916
do something worthwhile in life.

00:41:15.708 --> 00:41:17.541
I was stuck in a problem, Sam.

00:41:18.375 --> 00:41:19.916
- I didn't have a way out--
- Stop!

00:41:20.500 --> 00:41:22.833
I feel disgusted to see you.

00:41:38.916 --> 00:41:40.500
INDIRA LIBRARY

00:41:57.166 --> 00:41:58.208
What are you looking at?

00:41:59.041 --> 00:42:00.583
There's no chicken pieces for you today.

00:42:01.083 --> 00:42:02.166
I don't have money.

00:42:02.416 --> 00:42:03.750
If you want, eat this.

00:42:03.875 --> 00:42:08.625
<i>What's that sweet smell in the air?</i>
<i>Is it dope?</i>

00:42:08.791 --> 00:42:11.750
<i>Is it really there?</i>
<i>Do you smell it too?</i>

00:42:11.833 --> 00:42:13.083
- Hey!
- Huh?

00:42:13.625 --> 00:42:14.625
Who's that?

00:42:14.750 --> 00:42:16.500
What are you doing here, bro?

00:42:16.583 --> 00:42:18.833
First tell me what you're doing here.

00:42:18.916 --> 00:42:22.500
Um, I left some herb here.

00:42:23.541 --> 00:42:24.750
Oh, God.

00:42:31.083 --> 00:42:32.583
- Got a smoke?
- Yes I do, bro.

00:42:34.833 --> 00:42:35.833
Pour yourself a drink.

00:42:43.000 --> 00:42:44.500
Why did you take a loan, brother?

00:42:47.083 --> 00:42:48.625
When did I take a loan?

00:42:49.250 --> 00:42:51.000
My dad borrowed it all.

00:42:52.916 --> 00:42:54.958
He gambled away our property.

00:42:55.166 --> 00:42:59.166
He took loans promising to fix the
situation and brought us to the streets.

00:43:00.333 --> 00:43:02.375
All that was left was this library.

00:43:02.791 --> 00:43:03.916
Now, that's gone too.

00:43:04.208 --> 00:43:05.875
It's just a library, right? Don't bother.

00:43:10.708 --> 00:43:13.916
I see no difference
between my mother and this library.

00:43:16.166 --> 00:43:18.166
This library meant everything to her.

00:43:18.625 --> 00:43:20.041
She loved books.

00:43:21.666 --> 00:43:23.250
She cared for every book

00:43:25.125 --> 00:43:27.375
like she cared of me.

00:43:28.125 --> 00:43:30.833
She wanted everyone to learn
whatever she learnt.

00:43:34.166 --> 00:43:37.458
She turned our house into a library
just for this reason.

00:43:47.625 --> 00:43:48.666
We lived peacefully.

00:43:48.833 --> 00:43:50.875
But all my father's debt

00:43:51.166 --> 00:43:52.958
came back to haunt us with vengeance.

00:44:05.833 --> 00:44:07.541
Why are we suffering so much, Mom?

00:44:08.208 --> 00:44:10.000
Strangers come and insult us.

00:44:10.250 --> 00:44:13.291
Why don't we sell everything
and live happily?

00:44:14.458 --> 00:44:15.833
Why do you think like this?

00:44:16.333 --> 00:44:20.375
This library and these books
gave me a fresh start in life.

00:44:23.791 --> 00:44:24.708
Remember this.

00:44:24.833 --> 00:44:27.208
Creating something matters,

00:44:27.750 --> 00:44:30.375
but preserving it matters even more.

00:44:30.666 --> 00:44:32.666
I've created this bit by bit.

00:44:33.250 --> 00:44:35.416
Now you must preserve it safely.

00:44:43.083 --> 00:44:43.958
Mom.

00:44:45.708 --> 00:44:46.583
Mom?

00:44:49.333 --> 00:44:50.208
Mom?

00:44:51.250 --> 00:44:52.166
Mom?

00:44:53.000 --> 00:44:53.916
Mom!

00:44:55.666 --> 00:44:56.583
Mom!

00:45:00.250 --> 00:45:02.166
Hey! This doesn't concern you.

00:45:02.791 --> 00:45:05.208
His mother and father couldn't repay it.
Who'll pay me the money?

00:45:05.500 --> 00:45:07.416
Hey Doctor. You're the guarantee.

00:45:07.500 --> 00:45:09.750
I'll grab hold of you
if I don't get my money.

00:45:10.208 --> 00:45:11.208
He'll repay you.

00:45:12.708 --> 00:45:14.083
I have faith in him.

00:45:15.500 --> 00:45:17.208
Even when everyone left me,

00:45:17.916 --> 00:45:20.041
Neil was the only one who stood by me.

00:45:30.041 --> 00:45:31.083
Forgive me, bro.

00:45:32.541 --> 00:45:35.541
I can't believe I used such a great
library to fool around with some girl.

00:45:35.708 --> 00:45:37.625
Argh! Kill and bury me right here!

00:45:39.083 --> 00:45:41.708
All these years,
it was your mother's library.

00:45:42.166 --> 00:45:43.958
From today, it's our mother's library.

00:45:44.208 --> 00:45:46.583
We'll settle the loan on the library
and become millionaires. Okay?

00:45:47.041 --> 00:45:47.916
Mm.

00:45:48.250 --> 00:45:49.208
But before that…

00:45:53.458 --> 00:45:54.916
Try some. It'll keep you in high spirits.

00:45:55.875 --> 00:45:56.791
Try it.

00:46:05.583 --> 00:46:06.708
Caesar.

00:46:07.041 --> 00:46:08.791
This stuff is doing rounds in the city.

00:46:15.750 --> 00:46:16.875
Where did you get this?

00:46:17.500 --> 00:46:18.375
This…

00:46:19.125 --> 00:46:20.458
If you head to the theater,

00:46:20.583 --> 00:46:22.291
the guys would be selling it.
Do you want some?

00:46:27.625 --> 00:46:31.041
{\an8}A rusty door. Help me open it, I implore.

00:46:31.291 --> 00:46:33.166
Here I am, reciting poetry,

00:46:33.291 --> 00:46:35.083
- while you try to open the door.
- Oh, shut up.

00:46:37.083 --> 00:46:41.000
These idiots have taken my
whole library and dumped it here.

00:46:42.250 --> 00:46:45.250
All drunk boys. I'm steady…

00:46:46.250 --> 00:46:48.000
- Bro. Bro!
- Come on.

00:46:48.833 --> 00:46:50.666
Why have you brought me here?

00:46:50.750 --> 00:46:54.208
- Caesar.
- I'll go this way and you go this way.

00:46:54.291 --> 00:46:55.291
- Okay?
- Yes.

00:46:55.625 --> 00:46:59.041
Caesar… Caesar…

00:47:01.375 --> 00:47:04.625
I ended up losing it all
heeding your advice.

00:48:38.416 --> 00:48:43.333
<i>Wheels are turning,</i>
<i>I'm ready to make my move</i>

00:48:45.750 --> 00:48:47.250
<i>Watch me come</i>

00:48:49.666 --> 00:48:54.541
<i>I'm breaking every rule,</i>
<i>I'm coming in to hit hard</i>

00:48:57.000 --> 00:48:58.458
<i>Watch me come</i>

00:48:59.208 --> 00:49:01.708
Hey, who are you?!
Go away. Get lost!

00:49:02.250 --> 00:49:03.375
What are you staring at?
Go away!

00:49:04.583 --> 00:49:08.208
<i>Here to steal back what you stole,</i>
<i>I've come with my squad!</i>

00:49:08.333 --> 00:49:12.000
<i>I know your past,</i>
<i>I came to change the game</i>

00:49:12.083 --> 00:49:16.000
<i>You can go crazy,</i>
<i>I'll still stand my ground</i>

00:49:16.541 --> 00:49:18.958
<i>With fury, I'll come after you!</i>

00:49:19.125 --> 00:49:21.041
From what I heard, bro…

00:49:21.250 --> 00:49:23.166
there's this guy, Ezhil,
who walks around with a cane.

00:49:23.291 --> 00:49:25.333
He supplies Caesar to the city.

00:49:25.458 --> 00:49:26.833
I know one of his men.

00:49:26.958 --> 00:49:27.916
Hello, brother!

00:49:29.333 --> 00:49:32.083
Brother, where do you get
this stuff from?

00:49:32.750 --> 00:49:33.750
Mexico?

00:49:34.083 --> 00:49:35.958
- Or is it Georgia?
- Come here!

00:49:36.250 --> 00:49:38.833
- It hurts! It really does.
- You better buy and get out of here.

00:49:41.625 --> 00:49:44.083
- Hey!
- Sorry, brother. We won't do this again.

00:49:45.208 --> 00:49:47.375
- Beat it. Get scarce.
- I was asking just for general knowledge.

00:49:47.458 --> 00:49:48.625
- Get lost.
- Forgive me, it was a mistake.

00:49:57.750 --> 00:50:01.250
<i>We come in hard,</i>
<i>We make them run</i>

00:50:01.541 --> 00:50:05.125
<i>We go all in,</i>
<i>We push them out</i>

00:50:05.208 --> 00:50:08.750
<i>I'm here now,</i>
<i>So move aside</i>

00:50:09.041 --> 00:50:12.416
<i>Come at me,</i>
<i>And you'll fall apart</i>

00:50:12.833 --> 00:50:16.208
<i>I'm here now,</i>
<i>So move aside</i>

00:50:16.458 --> 00:50:19.958
<i>Come at me,</i>
<i>And you'll fall apart</i>

00:50:27.583 --> 00:50:28.791
- Tell me.
- Y.

00:50:29.208 --> 00:50:30.375
Someone's following me.

00:50:31.458 --> 00:50:33.541
It doesn't feel right. Look into it.

00:50:34.041 --> 00:50:35.041
I'll take care of it.

00:50:53.833 --> 00:50:54.708
Sam!

00:50:56.250 --> 00:50:58.250
Wait!
Sam! Sam!

00:51:10.291 --> 00:51:13.791
<i>I'm back for everything I lost</i>

00:51:14.041 --> 00:51:17.750
<i>Here to steal back what you stole,</i>
<i>I've come with my squad!</i>

00:51:17.875 --> 00:51:21.375
<i>I know your past,</i>
<i>I came to change the game</i>

00:51:21.541 --> 00:51:25.416
<i>You can go crazy,</i>
<i>I'll still stand my ground</i>

00:51:25.958 --> 00:51:29.333
<i>I'm here now,</i>
<i>So move aside</i>

00:51:29.625 --> 00:51:33.083
<i>Come at me,</i>
<i>And you'll fall apart</i>

00:51:33.458 --> 00:51:36.791
<i>I'm here now,</i>
<i>So move aside</i>

00:51:37.083 --> 00:51:40.458
<i>Come at me,</i>
<i>And you'll fall apart</i>

00:52:13.250 --> 00:52:16.416
You realize what this is by now,
don't you?

00:52:17.333 --> 00:52:20.208
Just answer my questions.

00:52:21.166 --> 00:52:23.916
Why are you following Vincent?

00:52:27.083 --> 00:52:28.875
No! No, no, no, no!

00:52:29.041 --> 00:52:29.958
No.

00:52:30.625 --> 00:52:32.083
To find Ezhil.

00:52:38.083 --> 00:52:39.791
How are you related to Ezhil?

00:52:39.916 --> 00:52:42.291
<i>Baava</i> had given Ezhil something.

00:52:42.750 --> 00:52:44.166
I came looking for that.

00:52:44.958 --> 00:52:46.166
<i>Baava?</i>

00:52:46.708 --> 00:52:47.833
Kotlapadi

00:52:48.291 --> 00:52:49.333
Veeraya

00:52:49.791 --> 00:52:50.875
Reddy.

00:52:51.750 --> 00:52:53.958
<i>Baava</i> began to hunt due to hunger.

00:52:54.541 --> 00:52:55.583
Soon after,

00:52:55.791 --> 00:52:57.958
the jungle fell under his control.

00:52:58.500 --> 00:53:02.166
Tiger skins. Elephant tusks.
Caesar.

00:53:02.500 --> 00:53:04.958
Drugs and much more.

00:53:05.208 --> 00:53:07.083
He has millions and millions.

00:53:07.250 --> 00:53:08.166
Black money.

00:53:16.833 --> 00:53:17.916
Who are they?

00:53:18.583 --> 00:53:19.958
- Come on, brother.
- Run!

00:53:20.041 --> 00:53:21.875
- Come on! They're here.
- Get in! Get in! Get in!

00:54:05.666 --> 00:54:07.833
Hey. Call Sarangi.

00:54:13.916 --> 00:54:15.500
Hello? Reddy <i>garu?</i>

00:54:16.291 --> 00:54:19.000
Police tried to kill me in an encounter
after finding my place.

00:54:19.250 --> 00:54:21.250
This wouldn't have happened
without the DGP's knowledge.

00:54:22.250 --> 00:54:24.166
Despite knowing everything about me

00:54:24.375 --> 00:54:27.625
his team and that mongrel DGP
wants to maul me.

00:54:31.916 --> 00:54:32.791
Brother!

00:54:35.833 --> 00:54:36.708
- Reddy <i>garu?</i>
- Leave him alone!

00:54:36.791 --> 00:54:38.208
They shot him! Brother!

00:54:41.958 --> 00:54:42.916
Reddy <i>garu?</i>

00:54:43.208 --> 00:54:44.208
Brother? Brother!

00:54:44.916 --> 00:54:47.041
- Do you hear me?
<i>- That locker had two keys.</i>

00:54:47.375 --> 00:54:49.666
Reddy <i>garu</i> died in that police encounter.

00:54:50.291 --> 00:54:51.416
His key was gone.

00:54:52.083 --> 00:54:54.041
He had given Ezhil the other key.

00:54:54.458 --> 00:54:55.875
I came looking for it.

00:54:56.375 --> 00:54:57.958
That key is needed

00:54:59.791 --> 00:55:00.791
to get to the money in that locker.

00:55:02.916 --> 00:55:05.458
- Hey!
- Are you telling me the truth?

00:55:06.333 --> 00:55:08.125
- Or are you lying?
- No!

00:55:09.458 --> 00:55:11.666
I don't really care.

00:55:13.333 --> 00:55:14.458
What do you want?

00:55:16.500 --> 00:55:17.791
What do you…

00:55:29.083 --> 00:55:30.250
I'll make you an offer.

00:55:30.375 --> 00:55:32.041
I don't know how much…

00:55:32.666 --> 00:55:34.041
you were paid to kill me.

00:55:34.541 --> 00:55:35.750
But if you let me live

00:55:38.208 --> 00:55:39.333
you get half

00:55:40.166 --> 00:55:41.333
of that money.

00:55:43.166 --> 00:55:44.083
Half?

00:55:44.708 --> 00:55:45.666
How much is that?

00:55:47.875 --> 00:55:49.291
Five hundred crores!

00:56:04.833 --> 00:56:05.833
Tell me.

00:56:06.000 --> 00:56:07.541
Want to switch to our mother
tongue, Tamil?

00:56:10.250 --> 00:56:11.208
Who are you?

00:56:14.833 --> 00:56:15.708
Caesar.

00:56:16.708 --> 00:56:18.125
Julius Caesar.

00:56:19.416 --> 00:56:20.333
You!

00:56:21.166 --> 00:56:23.750
- Do you know who you're talking to?
- I know.

00:56:24.166 --> 00:56:27.666
I know all too well that I'm talking to a
villain who runs an illegal gambling club

00:56:27.750 --> 00:56:30.333
and cons people of their money.

00:56:36.083 --> 00:56:38.708
I've seen a million scammers like you.

00:56:39.291 --> 00:56:40.291
Oh, quiet.

00:56:40.500 --> 00:56:42.000
You might have seen a million people.

00:56:42.500 --> 00:56:44.708
But you might not have seen
someone like me.

00:56:45.291 --> 00:56:47.791
I'm sending you some photos and videos.
Have a look.

00:57:12.458 --> 00:57:13.500
What's up, Vincy baby?

00:57:14.125 --> 00:57:15.375
Do I see fear in your face?

00:57:15.958 --> 00:57:17.666
All those people you con at the club

00:57:18.166 --> 00:57:20.125
won't they rip you to shreds
when they see this?

00:57:20.375 --> 00:57:22.708
If these videos came out,
you'd be in big trouble, Vincy baby.

00:57:23.416 --> 00:57:25.250
<i>Hello? Hello, hello?</i>

00:57:25.375 --> 00:57:27.750
- Lost you voice? You froze, Vincy baby?
- Hey!

00:57:27.833 --> 00:57:28.875
What the hell do you want?

00:57:29.625 --> 00:57:30.916
Let's start with some respect.

00:57:32.208 --> 00:57:34.125
- And then I need money.
- Tell me.

00:57:34.208 --> 00:57:35.083
<i>What?</i>

00:57:35.583 --> 00:57:37.708
Tell me, sir. How much do you want?

00:57:38.208 --> 00:57:41.750
You rip people off at your club
and earn millions. I don't need that much.

00:57:42.458 --> 00:57:43.666
One and a half crores
will be enough.

00:57:44.000 --> 00:57:46.916
I'll text you with the details
on how I want to receive it.

00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:50.125
Just pay me and walk off.

00:57:50.791 --> 00:57:52.458
If the money reaches me safely

00:57:52.833 --> 00:57:54.375
you'll receive the drive safely.

00:57:54.541 --> 00:57:56.833
If you're going to do something stupid

00:57:57.208 --> 00:57:58.333
the videos will be leaked.

00:57:58.666 --> 00:58:01.000
All news channels will telecast it live.

00:58:01.125 --> 00:58:02.333
I'll be enjoying the show.

00:58:03.333 --> 00:58:04.291
Promise.

00:58:11.875 --> 00:58:13.583
- Tell me.
- Check WhatsApp.

00:58:13.666 --> 00:58:17.083
Someone knows the secret only Ezhil and I
know, and they're blackmailing me.

00:58:17.833 --> 00:58:18.958
I have no idea

00:58:19.375 --> 00:58:20.750
what else is on that drive.

00:58:21.333 --> 00:58:23.875
If it's contents were to come out,
my life would be ruined.

00:58:24.041 --> 00:58:26.000
I want that drive in my hands.

00:58:26.375 --> 00:58:27.416
How much does he want?

00:58:27.750 --> 00:58:29.500
- One and a half crores.
- Tell him you'll pay.

00:58:30.041 --> 00:58:32.958
I'll kill him on the spot.
That pen drive will soon be yours.

00:58:33.041 --> 00:58:34.208
That's my responsibility.

00:58:53.333 --> 00:58:54.500
Ever seen this before?

00:59:01.916 --> 00:59:03.291
The key I was talking about

00:59:04.916 --> 00:59:05.958
is inside this.

00:59:23.041 --> 00:59:24.791
Tell me, bro. What do I do?

00:59:25.083 --> 00:59:28.000
Just shut up and sit inside
till I tell you.

00:59:28.208 --> 00:59:29.166
Okay.

00:59:44.250 --> 00:59:45.458
I've reached the spot you told me.

00:59:46.000 --> 00:59:49.500
Good boy. Now go ahead
and park your car on the fourth track.

01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:05.458
Leave the car there and go watch a movie
in the theater

01:00:05.708 --> 01:00:07.000
that's right across from you.

01:00:07.625 --> 01:00:08.541
Movie?

01:00:08.875 --> 01:00:10.000
Are we here to watch a movie?

01:00:10.291 --> 01:00:11.208
He never told me.

01:00:12.291 --> 01:00:14.000
- Are you kidding me?
- Hey.

01:00:14.500 --> 01:00:16.125
Do you only watch movies
that show in your theater?

01:00:16.375 --> 01:00:17.916
The one that's showing here
is pretty good too.

01:00:18.333 --> 01:00:19.416
Shut up and go watch the movie.

01:00:20.000 --> 01:00:22.708
By the time you're back,
the drive would've replaced the bag.

01:00:23.375 --> 01:00:24.916
- Enjoy the show, buddy.
- Hey!

01:00:27.833 --> 01:00:30.375
- Hey, are you ready?
- Bro.

01:00:31.833 --> 01:00:33.250
I'm terrified of heights.

01:00:33.583 --> 01:00:36.750
Please be careful.
Don't hold a grudge against me.

01:00:57.500 --> 01:00:59.291
Do you see the black color Volvo car

01:00:59.708 --> 01:01:01.083
on the fourth track?

01:01:01.291 --> 01:01:03.541
Volvo color, black car. Yeah.

01:01:03.625 --> 01:01:04.500
<i>Yes.</i>

01:01:04.583 --> 01:01:05.500
Head over there.

01:01:06.500 --> 01:01:10.458
One, two, three, four, five, seven…

01:01:10.541 --> 01:01:12.250
Hey! You nitwit!

01:01:13.375 --> 01:01:16.250
- Go back two feet.
- Nine, six.

01:01:17.750 --> 01:01:19.375
Do you see the black car near you?

01:01:19.958 --> 01:01:21.000
Open that car's boot.

01:01:22.333 --> 01:01:23.958
{\an8}Brother, the boot's missing!

01:01:25.708 --> 01:01:27.250
- You're baked, aren't you?
- Of course.

01:01:27.333 --> 01:01:28.666
I'll kill you when I see you!

01:01:29.750 --> 01:01:31.458
Head back. Head back!

01:01:31.916 --> 01:01:34.041
Oh, so the boot is in the back?

01:01:41.208 --> 01:01:42.208
Hi, sir.

01:01:43.041 --> 01:01:43.958
Bag, please.

01:01:44.916 --> 01:01:46.458
Oh, just the bag will do.

01:01:46.750 --> 01:01:48.000
What's happening?

01:01:48.375 --> 01:01:50.541
Bro, there's a nut job here

01:01:50.791 --> 01:01:53.791
- who's handing a gun instead of the bag.
- Run, K.G!

01:01:53.916 --> 01:01:55.041
Make a run for it!

01:01:56.875 --> 01:01:58.833
He's trying to shoot my guts off!

01:02:01.416 --> 01:02:03.875
- Sir, it wasn't me. I was just having fun.
- Hey, K.G!

01:02:03.958 --> 01:02:05.833
- Keep the drive safe!
- What? Which driver?

01:02:05.958 --> 01:02:07.375
That's the guy who's thrashing me now!

01:02:28.666 --> 01:02:29.750
Karma is a boomerang.

01:02:52.791 --> 01:02:54.541
Ow! Ow! Ow! Mummy!
That's hurting!

01:02:56.166 --> 01:02:57.458
Good lord!

01:02:58.750 --> 01:02:59.625
Hey! Let go!

01:03:06.500 --> 01:03:08.333
{\an8}Bro, he took the skull!

01:03:25.625 --> 01:03:26.625
I got the drive.

01:03:26.916 --> 01:03:28.333
Not one. There's two of them.

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:34.291
You took your sweet time.

01:05:00.416 --> 01:05:01.583
Bro! Oh, no!

01:05:02.833 --> 01:05:03.875
Give me the pen drive.

01:05:15.916 --> 01:05:16.916
Where's the drive?

01:05:36.250 --> 01:05:38.083
Bro, nice work!

01:05:40.083 --> 01:05:41.000
Hey!

01:05:41.625 --> 01:05:42.541
Damn it!

01:05:54.708 --> 01:05:59.250
<i>Sigma is out to slay all the enemies</i>
<i>Be aware!</i>

01:06:02.458 --> 01:06:06.750
<i>Sigma can't be seen going,</i>
<i>'Cause you all know he isn't afraid</i>

01:07:13.875 --> 01:07:15.333
He's been away for so long.

01:07:17.333 --> 01:07:18.541
Doctor, aren't you leaving?

01:07:18.958 --> 01:07:20.083
My car hasn't arrived.

01:07:20.333 --> 01:07:21.625
That piece of junk?

01:07:21.708 --> 01:07:23.666
Hey! What do you know about my car?

01:07:23.875 --> 01:07:27.500
It has horsepower. It has engine power.
It has all sorts of powers!

01:07:27.625 --> 01:07:31.583
That power helped me buy a house,
get married, and settle down in life.

01:07:32.000 --> 01:07:35.041
- It's my lucky car.
- Ca… Car!

01:07:35.625 --> 01:07:36.916
That's the power of my car!

01:07:37.375 --> 01:07:39.250
- Did you make the full payment on the car?
- Yes.

01:07:39.333 --> 01:07:40.916
- Then why do you have only half a car?
- Half?

01:07:42.000 --> 01:07:43.458
Where's the rest of my car?

01:07:43.833 --> 01:07:45.250
Hey. Careful!

01:07:46.041 --> 01:07:48.041
What have you done to my sweetheart?

01:07:48.125 --> 01:07:49.750
Hey! He's hurt!
We'll discuss everything later.

01:07:49.833 --> 01:07:51.125
- Treat him immediately.
- Take him inside.

01:07:51.416 --> 01:07:52.333
Okay, Doctor.

01:07:52.958 --> 01:07:55.541
- What happened?
- Oh, don't worry. Did you eat?

01:07:55.875 --> 01:07:58.250
- Talk to me, baby.
- First, we need to…

01:07:59.833 --> 01:08:01.666
Hey Doctor! Why are you acting
like a mad man?

01:08:01.750 --> 01:08:03.875
I told you he's hurt.
You can deal with this later. Come on!

01:08:05.291 --> 01:08:06.291
Okay, go.

01:08:06.833 --> 01:08:08.291
There goes all the power.

01:08:40.958 --> 01:08:42.625
There was this guy named Ezhil.

01:08:43.041 --> 01:08:45.166
- Where is he?
- I don't know! I don't know!

01:08:45.583 --> 01:08:47.833
How many times do I tell you?
I don't know!

01:08:48.458 --> 01:08:50.041
He told you he doesn't know.

01:08:50.750 --> 01:08:53.208
Why are you torturing him?
Who are you, anyway?

01:08:54.416 --> 01:08:55.333
Would you look at that?

01:08:57.500 --> 01:08:59.458
Do you play cards, darling?

01:09:00.833 --> 01:09:03.875
- Yes.
- Each symbol on a card has a meaning.

01:09:06.000 --> 01:09:07.583
Spade is the lord.

01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:09.750
That means it's the king.

01:09:10.416 --> 01:09:12.041
Heart? That's money.

01:09:13.250 --> 01:09:15.458
Diamond is the trader.

01:09:15.666 --> 01:09:17.916
Tell me what clover is? It's the farmer.

01:09:19.833 --> 01:09:22.125
The ruler invests on the farmer.

01:09:22.250 --> 01:09:27.000
The trader buys what the farmer produces,
sells it in the market,

01:09:27.083 --> 01:09:30.916
takes a commission and hands over
the rest of the money to the king.

01:09:31.208 --> 01:09:33.000
This is the norm all over the world.

01:09:36.541 --> 01:09:39.708
This was going fine
until a joker showed up.

01:09:40.166 --> 01:09:43.833
A trader named Ezhil,
taken in by the joker,

01:09:44.458 --> 01:09:46.333
thought he could do the same

01:09:46.666 --> 01:09:48.833
and went to the king.

01:09:49.166 --> 01:09:50.791
The king trusted him

01:09:51.541 --> 01:09:53.416
and gave him a thousand crores!

01:09:54.375 --> 01:09:55.458
And what happened now?

01:09:55.958 --> 01:09:57.375
The trader went missing,

01:09:58.041 --> 01:10:00.083
and the king's trust was broken.

01:10:00.791 --> 01:10:03.916
Now tell me, who would
the angry king go looking for?

01:10:05.166 --> 01:10:06.166
Correct!

01:10:07.041 --> 01:10:08.541
This joker.

01:10:12.875 --> 01:10:15.583
If he doesn't know,
he might as well be dead!

01:10:24.916 --> 01:10:26.250
The security guard is tied up here.

01:10:26.666 --> 01:10:27.583
So, who's this?

01:10:31.500 --> 01:10:34.166
I thought our last conversation was
when I saw you in the parking lot.

01:10:35.041 --> 01:10:37.875
But you're making a fuss.
You won't get your drive.

01:10:37.958 --> 01:10:39.916
Hey, sorry!
I'll pay you double.

01:10:40.041 --> 01:10:40.958
Give me the drive.

01:10:42.541 --> 01:10:44.500
That goon you hired to kill me?

01:10:46.000 --> 01:10:48.208
- Who's that?
<i>- You didn't take me seriously.</i>

01:10:49.000 --> 01:10:50.583
Hey, forget all this.

01:10:50.833 --> 01:10:53.125
I'll hand over that drive to the media.

01:10:53.375 --> 01:10:54.500
You deal with them.

01:10:56.166 --> 01:10:57.083
Hey!

01:10:57.208 --> 01:10:58.333
Do you know who I am?

01:10:58.791 --> 01:11:00.416
I don't understand a word
of what you said.

01:11:00.708 --> 01:11:01.916
- Hang up.
- Hey--

01:11:07.250 --> 01:11:08.291
Who was that?

01:11:08.583 --> 01:11:09.583
I don't know.

01:11:10.041 --> 01:11:12.833
He figured out something
only Ezhil and I knew

01:11:13.166 --> 01:11:14.250
and is blackmailing me.

01:11:15.000 --> 01:11:19.208
I would've cornered him and taken
everything had you not interfered!

01:11:20.041 --> 01:11:22.291
How did he figure out something

01:11:23.083 --> 01:11:24.291
only you two knew?

01:11:24.958 --> 01:11:26.166
Maybe through Ezhil.

01:11:26.500 --> 01:11:28.708
Catch hold of him
and he'll talk about Ezhil.

01:11:29.166 --> 01:11:30.125
Give me my phone.

01:11:40.500 --> 01:11:41.958
He's using this drive to blackmail me.

01:11:55.125 --> 01:11:56.458
Until we find the guy who just called

01:11:56.583 --> 01:11:58.708
- Yes, <i>Annayya.</i>
- we'll stay in this house.

01:11:58.833 --> 01:11:59.791
- Okay, <i>Annayya.</i>
<i>- Okay.</i>

01:12:03.000 --> 01:12:03.958
Give me my phone.

01:12:09.958 --> 01:12:11.458
Have you seen her anywhere?

01:12:25.666 --> 01:12:29.875
You've pulled off mission impossible
with some guy without involving me.

01:12:30.291 --> 01:12:31.833
You've wrecked my car too.

01:12:32.250 --> 01:12:34.291
Hey, quit whining.

01:12:34.875 --> 01:12:38.375
- I'm single.
- When a single like you needs this much,

01:12:38.541 --> 01:12:40.000
imagine how much I would need
as a family man.

01:12:40.166 --> 01:12:42.750
- Forget that, who's paying for my car?!
- Hey! Quiet now.

01:12:43.125 --> 01:12:45.000
It's just a car. I'll buy you a new one.

01:12:45.666 --> 01:12:48.541
- Let it go.
- You just made a mistake.

01:12:49.125 --> 01:12:51.416
Tell me, sir.
What mistake have I committed?

01:12:51.791 --> 01:12:54.916
If you leak this to the media
why would he pay you?

01:12:56.666 --> 01:12:58.708
We need to say that so he's scared.

01:12:58.833 --> 01:13:00.958
We get the money only as long
as he's scared, right?

01:13:01.583 --> 01:13:03.291
- Oh.
- Oh!

01:13:03.375 --> 01:13:04.791
So that's your plan, Guru?

01:13:05.958 --> 01:13:08.333
To make this mission impossible possible

01:13:08.708 --> 01:13:09.791
I should join…

01:13:10.125 --> 01:13:11.208
<i>Impossible.</i>

01:13:11.875 --> 01:13:15.208
<i>We are all waiting for something</i>
<i>important in our lives.</i>

01:13:15.833 --> 01:13:17.541
<i>That's what we're talking about today.</i>

01:13:24.416 --> 01:13:25.375
Fool!

01:13:30.791 --> 01:13:32.333
<i>- It will scream into your ears.</i>
- Hey!

01:13:32.666 --> 01:13:34.541
<i>- Instead of letting it bother you</i>
<i>- Annaya?</i>

01:13:34.666 --> 01:13:37.000
<i>- lead your life with joy and happiness</i>
- Increase the volume.

01:13:37.083 --> 01:13:40.000
<i>and peace. Let's go to our next caller.</i>

01:13:50.791 --> 01:13:52.541
<i>There was this guy named Ezhil.</i>

01:13:52.833 --> 01:13:53.750
<i>Where is he?</i>

01:13:57.791 --> 01:13:58.708
{\an8}Vince.

01:13:59.458 --> 01:14:02.041
{\an8}Why don't you start a chain of clubs
like the one you own?

01:14:02.916 --> 01:14:04.250
I've even found the person to fund you.

01:14:04.875 --> 01:14:08.000
No, when you commit a crime in one place

01:14:08.708 --> 01:14:09.666
you won't get caught.

01:14:10.000 --> 01:14:11.000
But

01:14:11.708 --> 01:14:13.041
when you do it in multiple places

01:14:13.625 --> 01:14:14.708
you're bound to get caught.

01:14:27.875 --> 01:14:28.791
No, Vince.

01:14:29.416 --> 01:14:30.291
Sir.

01:14:30.750 --> 01:14:31.708
We need you out there.

01:14:39.458 --> 01:14:40.916
Meghna? Meghna?

01:14:43.000 --> 01:14:43.916
Get the car.

01:14:48.458 --> 01:14:50.625
{\an8}TOP ACTRESS MEGHNA
THE FILM INDUSTRY IN TURMOIL

01:14:51.458 --> 01:14:53.208
You're the cause of all the problems.

01:14:53.791 --> 01:14:57.000
I spent 50 lakhs just to cover up
the Meghna thing.

01:14:57.625 --> 01:15:01.708
I didn't have a single problem
when this place was just a club.

01:15:02.458 --> 01:15:06.000
Something's wrong with your stuff.

01:15:06.791 --> 01:15:09.916
That's why she overdosed
and went into a coma.

01:15:10.500 --> 01:15:13.125
Stop selling Caesar here from now.

01:15:15.333 --> 01:15:17.125
Quit playing around, Vince.

01:15:17.208 --> 01:15:19.250
Do you know the value of the drugs
that comes in here?

01:15:19.375 --> 01:15:24.625
You want me to risk it all
by finding a new, safe place to stock it?

01:15:24.750 --> 01:15:26.375
That's your problem.

01:15:26.708 --> 01:15:29.250
I don't want to see anyone inside
the club with Caesar.

01:15:29.583 --> 01:15:30.750
This is my club.

01:15:31.458 --> 01:15:32.541
It's my order.

01:15:43.125 --> 01:15:44.125
Hey, Vicky.

01:15:44.916 --> 01:15:48.041
- How's it going?
- Don't ask. You always win.

01:15:59.125 --> 01:16:03.500
Look, Vincent. You know how many in here
overdose every month.

01:16:03.958 --> 01:16:07.458
Besides that the pressure from the
Inspector and AC is too much.

01:16:07.958 --> 01:16:09.791
This isn't enough to shut them up.

01:16:10.583 --> 01:16:11.583
How about

01:16:12.333 --> 01:16:13.666
you pay me two crores

01:16:14.541 --> 01:16:15.708
and I'll settle things
permanently for you?

01:16:39.375 --> 01:16:41.125
Hey. What did I tell you?

01:16:41.291 --> 01:16:43.416
One more guy collapsed
from an overdose today.

01:16:43.500 --> 01:16:47.208
- I just spent two crores fixing it.
- Vincent.

01:16:47.875 --> 01:16:49.375
Are we selling vaccines here?

01:16:50.041 --> 01:16:51.875
Caesar. We're selling hard drugs.

01:16:52.208 --> 01:16:53.958
A few in hundred will end up like that.

01:16:54.166 --> 01:16:55.250
What can we do about it?

01:16:55.625 --> 01:16:57.833
No one died, right?

01:16:59.041 --> 01:17:00.916
Let them die! Why would I care?

01:17:01.208 --> 01:17:02.458
You'll walk away from this.

01:17:02.833 --> 01:17:05.375
The police will start looking into me.

01:17:07.458 --> 01:17:08.500
I'll burn it down.

01:17:10.750 --> 01:17:13.083
Do you know how much that's worth?

01:17:18.125 --> 01:17:19.750
You own just the club.

01:17:20.458 --> 01:17:21.375
The idea.

01:17:22.000 --> 01:17:23.083
This business.

01:17:23.541 --> 01:17:25.458
Every dime you earned belongs to me.

01:17:26.166 --> 01:17:29.416
If I wanted to, I can kill you right now.
You want to see?

01:17:31.208 --> 01:17:34.041
You. You're going to kill me?

01:17:34.500 --> 01:17:36.625
Do it! Do it! Do it!

01:17:37.041 --> 01:17:38.375
Do it! Do it!

01:17:38.541 --> 01:17:39.916
Do it! Do it!

01:17:40.083 --> 01:17:41.458
Do it! Do it!

01:17:44.125 --> 01:17:45.041
Do it!

01:17:58.458 --> 01:17:59.458
You should leave.

01:18:00.791 --> 01:18:01.666
Now.

01:18:25.875 --> 01:18:27.125
Why are you struggling by yourself?

01:18:28.875 --> 01:18:30.000
I'll help you.

01:18:30.666 --> 01:18:31.958
I won't run away.

01:19:05.208 --> 01:19:06.250
What happened?

01:19:07.166 --> 01:19:08.291
Who did this to you?

01:19:09.750 --> 01:19:10.708
Kotlapadi

01:19:11.291 --> 01:19:12.291
Reddy.

01:19:13.166 --> 01:19:14.291
What nonsense are you talking?

01:19:29.875 --> 01:19:34.208
He managed to fool everyone
and come here in search of the key.

01:19:35.208 --> 01:19:39.083
<i>If Reddy has let him off</i>
<i>there must be a reason behind it.</i>

01:19:39.916 --> 01:19:40.833
What?

01:19:41.666 --> 01:19:42.916
Are you plotting something?

01:19:44.958 --> 01:19:46.833
I need that money

01:19:48.333 --> 01:19:49.500
before Reddy gets to it.

01:19:52.875 --> 01:19:54.166
We need that money.

01:20:01.416 --> 01:20:02.541
I need to rest.

01:20:23.750 --> 01:20:26.583
Tazobactam? That medicine's costly.

01:20:27.000 --> 01:20:28.000
Who suggested it?

01:20:28.583 --> 01:20:29.958
You need to ask the doctor.

01:20:31.083 --> 01:20:33.916
Hey. I'm Doctor Neil.
That's why I'm asking you.

01:20:34.000 --> 01:20:35.000
Why are you here?

01:20:37.125 --> 01:20:38.750
- Sam.
- Did you bring my money?

01:20:39.250 --> 01:20:41.125
Money, money, money.
Isn't Dad far more important?

01:20:41.416 --> 01:20:43.333
My dad needs the money.

01:20:44.083 --> 01:20:48.083
- Sam, just give me a--
- What? You'll pay me in two days?

01:20:50.041 --> 01:20:53.333
You can't even keep
another person's money safe.

01:20:53.416 --> 01:20:56.666
- Get the facts before you speak, Sam.
- I don't want your explanation.

01:20:56.833 --> 01:20:59.250
Silence, please. We have patients here.

01:20:59.333 --> 01:21:00.875
- Where are they?
- Aren't you a doctor?

01:21:01.666 --> 01:21:03.083
Doctor? Yes.

01:21:06.166 --> 01:21:07.875
You need the money, right?
Come with me.

01:21:11.250 --> 01:21:12.333
You'll get your money.

01:21:12.416 --> 01:21:14.541
Doctor, don't be around him.

01:21:15.833 --> 01:21:17.041
He'll scam you too.

01:21:17.791 --> 01:21:21.666
Sam, he might just own a library today.
In a week, he'll become a millionaire

01:21:21.833 --> 01:21:24.125
and pay you the money. I guarantee that!

01:21:25.625 --> 01:21:27.500
Doctor. Drink this.

01:21:28.708 --> 01:21:29.750
Why, Doctor?

01:21:30.291 --> 01:21:31.291
In a week?

01:21:32.791 --> 01:21:34.166
Are you guys up to no good?

01:21:37.333 --> 01:21:38.708
Give me a straight answer.

01:21:39.708 --> 01:21:40.750
What are you going to do?

01:21:41.666 --> 01:21:43.375
I'm scared, man. Tell her.

01:21:56.708 --> 01:21:59.041
Just be happy you're alive today.

01:21:59.458 --> 01:22:00.541
What if something happened to you?

01:22:01.041 --> 01:22:02.416
They'll steal from us.

01:22:02.916 --> 01:22:04.083
Do whatever they want.

01:22:04.416 --> 01:22:05.791
And we're supposed to do nothing?

01:22:06.000 --> 01:22:07.000
Sam.

01:22:08.291 --> 01:22:10.791
I'm not in a situation to choose between
what's right and what's wrong.

01:22:11.416 --> 01:22:13.083
I don't expect you to believe me either.

01:22:13.791 --> 01:22:16.083
But I hope you'd forgive me at least.

01:22:17.250 --> 01:22:18.541
What are we going to do now?

01:22:19.250 --> 01:22:20.833
I underestimated him last time.

01:22:21.000 --> 01:22:23.625
There's someone else with him,
like a bodyguard.

01:22:23.833 --> 01:22:26.375
Tough as nails.
Just like The Undertaker.

01:22:29.291 --> 01:22:30.458
We need to split them up.

01:22:30.708 --> 01:22:31.833
We need to extract money from one guy

01:22:32.541 --> 01:22:33.750
and hand over the drive to the other.

01:22:34.708 --> 01:22:36.583
This time, we need to hit

01:22:37.875 --> 01:22:38.833
bullseye.

01:22:40.000 --> 01:22:42.208
{\an8}Doctor. Wait outside Vincent's home.

01:22:42.416 --> 01:22:43.791
Vincent will leave by car
to collect the drive.

01:22:44.333 --> 01:22:47.375
The Undertaker will follow him
to give the money.

01:22:47.541 --> 01:22:51.041
If something goes wrong,
please call and give me an update.

01:22:51.375 --> 01:22:54.291
Just like clockwork.
No problem.

01:22:54.750 --> 01:22:56.000
I'll take care of Vincent.

01:22:56.375 --> 01:22:58.375
That Undertaker will come to
the location we tell him.

01:22:58.666 --> 01:23:00.000
Our K.G will be there.

01:23:01.333 --> 01:23:04.375
What? Bro, why do you keep putting me
up against that guy?

01:23:04.458 --> 01:23:06.625
I've already had my share from him.
Why don't you send

01:23:06.833 --> 01:23:07.791
the doctor this time.

01:23:33.541 --> 01:23:34.458
What? A Gun?!

01:23:35.083 --> 01:23:37.375
That guy does tricks with just a knife.

01:23:37.583 --> 01:23:38.666
Psycho maniac.

01:23:45.208 --> 01:23:46.791
Why's my hand so shaky?

01:23:55.375 --> 01:23:58.833
What if he's hidden a bomb
under the money in the duffel bag?

01:23:59.791 --> 01:24:01.000
Bomb?!

01:24:02.958 --> 01:24:04.000
Very bad.

01:24:04.125 --> 01:24:06.208
Can we please come up
with another plan?

01:24:06.500 --> 01:24:10.666
Somehow her plan scares me more
than that goon.

01:24:13.208 --> 01:24:14.291
Look, guys.

01:24:14.583 --> 01:24:16.291
We don't have to go anywhere.

01:24:17.041 --> 01:24:18.708
The hangout spot in our hood
is the cemetery.

01:24:19.166 --> 01:24:21.041
Let's ask them to come there.

01:24:21.291 --> 01:24:23.750
Let's dig a pit there.

01:24:23.916 --> 01:24:26.958
Let them drop the money in it
and fill the hole.

01:24:27.458 --> 01:24:28.833
We can dig it out later.

01:24:28.916 --> 01:24:30.791
- Do you think that'll work?
- Of course.

01:24:37.875 --> 01:24:38.875
It didn't work.

01:24:42.375 --> 01:24:45.208
Besides Vincent and The Undertaker

01:24:46.166 --> 01:24:50.708
what if someone else was involved
on their side?

01:24:51.291 --> 01:24:52.833
- Huh?
- There's this guy.

01:24:54.500 --> 01:24:55.708
The confusion he created

01:24:56.833 --> 01:24:58.041
led to our escape.

01:24:58.750 --> 01:25:00.291
Yes. Reddy <i>garu.</i>

01:25:00.375 --> 01:25:01.708
<i>What? Garu?</i>

01:25:02.208 --> 01:25:03.958
Tell me everything you know about him.

01:25:04.125 --> 01:25:05.791
Did you notice the number
on his car?

01:25:07.000 --> 01:25:09.958
AP means Andhra. Andhra means Reddy.

01:25:10.250 --> 01:25:12.666
Reddy <i>garu.</i>
Reddy's car is Reddy <i>garu.</i>

01:25:13.958 --> 01:25:15.500
I'm stuck with you guys.

01:25:16.666 --> 01:25:18.208
Oh, my!

01:25:20.250 --> 01:25:21.250
Yuck!

01:25:28.916 --> 01:25:33.000
Hey KG, where's the guy
who gets stuff from the harbor?

01:25:40.666 --> 01:25:43.708
Hey, didn't I tell you
not to come here.

01:25:49.791 --> 01:25:52.916
I'll keep coming here till you tell me
where you're getting your supply from.

01:25:53.541 --> 01:25:54.916
Hey, where are you guys?

01:25:55.041 --> 01:25:56.458
- Come here!
- Come on!

01:26:12.791 --> 01:26:13.666
Hey!

01:26:19.750 --> 01:26:21.916
I hope you have an answer now.

01:26:25.125 --> 01:26:26.708
Hello. Guru?

01:26:27.208 --> 01:26:29.208
I've found a place.

01:26:29.500 --> 01:26:31.791
I'm in the middle of something.
I'll call you when I'm done.

01:26:32.000 --> 01:26:32.875
Huh?

01:26:34.458 --> 01:26:35.500
Tell me now.

01:26:38.875 --> 01:26:40.000
<i>Hey Vijaya.</i>

01:26:41.250 --> 01:26:43.458
<i>I'll separate you from your husband,</i>

01:26:44.375 --> 01:26:46.875
<i>turn his family against you,</i>

01:26:47.500 --> 01:26:51.333
<i>take away your property</i>
<i>and throw you out on the streets…</i>

01:26:51.416 --> 01:26:54.125
<i>Or I'm not Annakodi's son,</i>
<i>Chinnakodi!</i>

01:26:54.833 --> 01:26:56.083
{\an8}TO BE CONTINUED…

01:26:56.208 --> 01:26:59.458
Hey, who the hell is this guy,
showing off his bravery to a woman?

01:27:01.458 --> 01:27:02.833
- Hello…
- Hey!

01:27:05.875 --> 01:27:07.750
Better wipe it off.
I'll deal with you later.

01:27:08.333 --> 01:27:10.041
- Drag him here.
- Okay.

01:27:10.166 --> 01:27:11.208
Let's put an end to this.

01:27:12.375 --> 01:27:13.625
No continuity.

01:27:15.916 --> 01:27:16.916
Phone, <i>Annaya.</i>

01:27:18.291 --> 01:27:20.083
Hey. Welcome back.

01:27:20.541 --> 01:27:23.875
Your guy has sent a video
from your security's phone.

01:27:24.041 --> 01:27:25.625
Let's see what he has sent.

01:27:26.083 --> 01:27:27.166
Go away, child.

01:27:27.541 --> 01:27:29.916
I'll listen to your
soap opera stories later.

01:27:31.458 --> 01:27:32.541
Woah, look at her blush!

01:27:33.958 --> 01:27:34.958
Want to see?

01:27:37.500 --> 01:27:38.375
Watch.

01:28:02.791 --> 01:28:03.791
Get the car.

01:28:04.166 --> 01:28:05.166
Oh!

01:28:07.916 --> 01:28:09.375
- Is that our stuff?
- Yeah.

01:28:09.916 --> 01:28:11.208
It's incredibly powerful, isn't it?

01:28:11.541 --> 01:28:13.708
Reduce the potency a bit.

01:28:14.083 --> 01:28:17.083
Who do we sell to
if the customers begin to die?

01:28:25.583 --> 01:28:28.875
So, Vince. We wanted 1.5 crore
for the last clip.

01:28:29.333 --> 01:28:32.625
This clip is quite the find.
How much do you think I should ask?

01:28:33.375 --> 01:28:36.291
If you plan to pull off something stupid
like last time…

01:28:36.625 --> 01:28:39.250
Your clips will run on all TV channels.

01:28:39.458 --> 01:28:41.833
- The whole world will know.
- Don't do something like that.

01:28:42.500 --> 01:28:44.750
I'll pay you what you want.
Okay?

01:28:44.958 --> 01:28:46.458
Now that's a good criminal.

01:28:47.000 --> 01:28:49.041
Six crore and twelve lakhs.

01:28:51.250 --> 01:28:54.375
- What kind of number is that?
- My car costs 12 lakhs! Who'll pay that?

01:28:55.333 --> 01:28:56.833
- Wait. Calm down.
- Hey.

01:28:58.250 --> 01:29:00.583
You heard him, Vince.
Send what he said.

01:29:01.166 --> 01:29:04.333
The most important thing, Vince,
is to bring the money in dollars.

01:29:05.583 --> 01:29:08.583
If I get the drive, I'll let you live.

01:29:08.833 --> 01:29:12.166
- Otherwise no one will live.
- Come on, little boy.

01:29:13.000 --> 01:29:14.083
Reddy <i>garu…</i>

01:29:14.625 --> 01:29:15.583
Are you well?

01:29:18.541 --> 01:29:20.833
You might've fooled the world
into thinking you died, Reddy,

01:29:21.125 --> 01:29:22.125
but not me.

01:29:22.916 --> 01:29:23.958
You are no longer a tiger.

01:29:24.583 --> 01:29:26.208
You're like a rat stuck in a trap.

01:29:26.791 --> 01:29:29.333
Shut up and listen to me. Got it?

01:29:29.416 --> 01:29:31.291
If you pay the money we ask for
without a hitch…

01:29:31.416 --> 01:29:33.125
The drive will come to you.

01:29:33.208 --> 01:29:35.166
Otherwise, the police will come for you.

01:29:35.625 --> 01:29:38.333
We'll text you the details
of where we want the money delivered.

01:29:38.708 --> 01:29:39.666
- Bye!
- Hey--

01:29:41.458 --> 01:29:43.583
You managed to anger Reddy.

01:29:43.875 --> 01:29:45.500
He's going to turn rabid and bite you!

01:29:48.458 --> 01:29:51.416
Dog bites can be treated,
but what about human bites?

01:29:53.416 --> 01:29:55.291
I've bought the items you wanted.
It's in here.

01:31:07.458 --> 01:31:09.041
- Hello?
- I'm here.

01:31:09.250 --> 01:31:10.333
Super.

01:31:10.708 --> 01:31:12.375
Just keep walking as I say.

01:31:14.625 --> 01:31:16.208
Guys. All set.

01:31:16.708 --> 01:31:18.000
Hello, everyone!

01:31:19.208 --> 01:31:20.125
Hi!

01:31:22.041 --> 01:31:23.375
- Ready.
- Ready, bro.

01:31:23.458 --> 01:31:24.333
Okay.

01:31:25.541 --> 01:31:26.750
Welcome, folks!

01:31:27.000 --> 01:31:30.250
I welcome you all to the street carnival.

01:31:32.458 --> 01:31:34.333
Now, we're going to play a game.

01:31:34.458 --> 01:31:36.875
The game is called "pick a color."

01:31:37.083 --> 01:31:38.625
I'll mention a color.

01:31:38.791 --> 01:31:42.333
You need to find and touch that color
within ten seconds.

01:31:42.666 --> 01:31:44.291
- Are you ready?
- Yes!

01:31:50.750 --> 01:31:53.000
Guru, someone's right behind Vincent.

01:31:53.375 --> 01:31:54.875
Doctor, that must be the goon.

01:31:55.458 --> 01:31:56.458
Goon?

01:31:56.791 --> 01:31:58.000
He looks like a grandpa.

01:31:58.333 --> 01:31:59.666
Whoever it is, let them come.

01:32:00.833 --> 01:32:01.750
Sam.

01:32:02.541 --> 01:32:04.166
Game on.

01:32:04.458 --> 01:32:06.041
Your color is

01:32:06.291 --> 01:32:08.375
- turquoise!
- Turquoise?

01:32:08.583 --> 01:32:10.416
- Isn't turquoise a shade of blue?
- Brother.

01:32:10.875 --> 01:32:11.916
- What color is that?
- Get lost.

01:32:12.000 --> 01:32:13.000
Turquoise, guys.

01:32:13.083 --> 01:32:16.708
- It's a mix of blue and green.
- It's right there! Look! Look!

01:32:19.375 --> 01:32:22.916
Those who couldn't touch it,
get ready for the catchers!

01:32:31.541 --> 01:32:34.208
You fooled me with that comb!
Keep cheating.

01:32:34.500 --> 01:32:37.250
Those who're eliminated go in the cage.

01:32:37.500 --> 01:32:38.666
Sorry, guys.

01:32:39.666 --> 01:32:42.625
- I've reached the place you told me.
- Do you see a <i>biryani</i> shop?

01:32:43.583 --> 01:32:44.625
Head there quickly.

01:32:47.125 --> 01:32:48.083
Biryani?

01:32:49.750 --> 01:32:55.333
Those who weren't eliminated
get an unlimited biryani coupon!

01:32:55.791 --> 01:32:57.083
I've reached the biryani stall.

01:32:57.208 --> 01:32:58.916
There's a spot behind the stall.

01:32:59.625 --> 01:33:02.333
- Leave the bag there and walk off.
- Hey! Do I look like a fool?

01:33:03.166 --> 01:33:04.041
Sorry, sir.

01:33:06.083 --> 01:33:07.500
Do I?!

01:33:08.708 --> 01:33:09.791
Give me the drive first!

01:33:10.375 --> 01:33:11.583
Hey, Vince.

01:33:13.375 --> 01:33:15.250
You're not in a position
to give me orders.

01:33:15.875 --> 01:33:17.708
Just shut up and listen.

01:33:17.916 --> 01:33:21.208
Do you see three balloons in front of you
swaying left and right to the wind?

01:33:22.666 --> 01:33:24.916
Let's take a small break now.

01:33:25.125 --> 01:33:27.375
Till then, enjoy some music.

01:33:27.916 --> 01:33:29.625
Your pen drive
is in one of those balloons.

01:33:34.416 --> 01:33:36.416
- Launch the Eagle.
- Okay, sir.

01:33:36.500 --> 01:33:38.125
- Find Vincent. Quick!
- Copy that.

01:33:38.750 --> 01:33:39.916
Hey, there's a drone!

01:33:40.125 --> 01:33:41.291
They're launched a drone.

01:33:41.416 --> 01:33:44.083
It's a Chinese drone.
That's not a problem for us.

01:33:44.958 --> 01:33:46.166
Grab the bag now.

01:33:48.958 --> 01:33:51.041
- Bro. A bag!
- Yeah.

01:33:51.541 --> 01:33:52.500
It's a bag.

01:33:52.833 --> 01:33:55.083
What did you think that was?
Check its contents!

01:34:00.958 --> 01:34:01.875
Bro…

01:34:01.958 --> 01:34:04.208
- It's filled with junk paper!
- Junk?

01:34:04.750 --> 01:34:05.833
Something's not right.

01:34:06.208 --> 01:34:07.416
Did you check properly?

01:34:08.916 --> 01:34:09.958
Hey, give me that!

01:34:11.416 --> 01:34:12.500
Damn it!

01:34:15.375 --> 01:34:18.208
- Target is disguised as the Joker.
- Don't let him escape.

01:34:18.375 --> 01:34:19.500
- Keep following him.
- Uh-oh!

01:34:21.375 --> 01:34:22.250
This damn thing!

01:34:23.833 --> 01:34:24.875
Move!

01:34:25.833 --> 01:34:27.666
Are you guys seriously chasing me
with a helicopter over paper scraps?

01:34:28.250 --> 01:34:30.000
Let's celebrate the winners!

01:34:30.166 --> 01:34:31.291
Are you ready?

01:34:32.083 --> 01:34:33.250
Count with me.

01:34:33.333 --> 01:34:34.791
- Three!
- Three.

01:34:35.041 --> 01:34:36.541
- Two!
- Two.

01:34:36.916 --> 01:34:38.333
- One!
- one.

01:34:39.041 --> 01:34:40.916
Go!

01:34:41.791 --> 01:34:43.166
Woo hoo!

01:34:48.291 --> 01:34:49.166
Hey!

01:34:50.000 --> 01:34:51.375
Where's the goddamn drive?

01:34:55.833 --> 01:34:58.875
- We've completely lost him.
- Where did you last see the Joker?

01:34:58.958 --> 01:35:00.041
He was headed to the stage, sir.

01:35:03.541 --> 01:35:04.500
Where's the drive?

01:35:05.125 --> 01:35:06.750
- Where's my money?
- Hey!

01:35:07.375 --> 01:35:09.208
If I see you, I'll kill you!

01:35:09.625 --> 01:35:11.583
I'm right behind you. Come on!

01:35:20.791 --> 01:35:21.958
There's a black sheep

01:35:22.041 --> 01:35:24.416
that has fooled us
and is amidst the crowd.

01:35:24.625 --> 01:35:26.041
Shall we nab it now?

01:35:27.958 --> 01:35:28.958
You bloody…

01:35:31.916 --> 01:35:32.916
Let me go!

01:35:33.541 --> 01:35:34.666
That's it. Come on!

01:35:34.958 --> 01:35:36.250
You call this a plan?

01:35:40.083 --> 01:35:41.000
Let's go!

01:35:41.541 --> 01:35:42.416
Bye!

01:36:09.541 --> 01:36:11.750
Guru, someone's standing with a bag.

01:36:14.125 --> 01:36:15.000
Looks like

01:36:15.083 --> 01:36:16.625
Kotlapadi Veeraya Reddy.

01:36:19.958 --> 01:36:20.916
Hey Guru.

01:36:21.416 --> 01:36:22.375
Why's Reddy

01:36:23.375 --> 01:36:25.250
dancing with a tiger mask on?

01:36:26.541 --> 01:36:29.083
He's got moves but he's not as good as me.

01:37:04.208 --> 01:37:06.750
Sam, Reddy just caught Guru.

01:39:10.333 --> 01:39:12.375
Hey, I'm already near the van.

01:39:12.458 --> 01:39:13.458
You take your time.

01:39:15.041 --> 01:39:16.041
Hey!

01:39:16.583 --> 01:39:17.666
What are you doing here?

01:39:22.250 --> 01:39:23.666
You thought you could ditch me here?

01:39:24.916 --> 01:39:26.750
Hey, where's bro?

01:39:31.041 --> 01:39:33.333
Where's the key? My key.

01:39:41.750 --> 01:39:44.041
- Come on. Hurry!
- Careful, Guru. Careful now.

01:39:45.583 --> 01:39:46.458
Hey.

01:39:47.416 --> 01:39:48.916
Who told you to come here?

01:39:51.250 --> 01:39:52.125
Come.

01:39:57.625 --> 01:39:58.708
Money. Wow!

01:39:58.958 --> 01:40:00.000
Brother.

01:40:01.750 --> 01:40:07.333
<i>Luck keeps shining on us!</i>
<i>Are our good times finally here?</i>

01:40:07.500 --> 01:40:08.833
<i>Reddy's</i>

01:40:09.041 --> 01:40:10.416
<i>All money</i>

01:40:10.583 --> 01:40:12.791
<i>This is a stroke of good fortune</i>

01:40:15.250 --> 01:40:17.000
Phew! Finally.

01:40:17.541 --> 01:40:18.833
Yay!

01:40:19.291 --> 01:40:20.666
Hey. Check the money.

01:40:20.750 --> 01:40:25.541
It's very difficult to earn
an honest living these days.

01:40:34.583 --> 01:40:35.500
Bro?

01:40:35.666 --> 01:40:37.333
Hey. It's a tracker.

01:40:40.375 --> 01:40:41.375
Huh?

01:40:49.958 --> 01:40:51.208
Reddy.

01:40:58.166 --> 01:40:59.083
Reddy…

01:41:07.041 --> 01:41:08.000
Oh, my!

01:41:29.875 --> 01:41:30.875
Let go!

01:41:34.666 --> 01:41:36.083
- God…
- Doctor! Hey!

01:41:36.333 --> 01:41:37.958
- Hey!
- Grab me! Don't let go!

01:41:38.041 --> 01:41:40.333
- No! Doctor!
- Don't let go!

01:41:46.291 --> 01:41:48.083
- Grab me! Grab me! Grab me! Hey!
- Come here!

01:41:48.166 --> 01:41:49.833
Grab me! Grab me!

01:41:50.208 --> 01:41:51.625
- Don't let go of me!
- Doctor!

01:41:51.708 --> 01:41:52.958
- Hey Doctor!
- Don't let go of me!

01:41:53.041 --> 01:41:54.458
- Oh God!
- God that hurts!

01:41:57.208 --> 01:41:58.541
Oh my God!

01:42:06.958 --> 01:42:08.333
{\an8}- Bro, grab this.
- Doctor!

01:42:09.416 --> 01:42:10.458
Hey, hold tight!

01:42:13.958 --> 01:42:15.708
- Hey!
- Careful!

01:42:19.583 --> 01:42:21.500
Hey! Where's the drive?

01:42:21.916 --> 01:42:22.875
Tell me.

01:42:25.916 --> 01:42:28.625
Are you going to answer
or do you want me to kill her?

01:42:29.166 --> 01:42:30.166
Tell me!

01:42:39.791 --> 01:42:40.791
Hey!

01:43:14.791 --> 01:43:17.375
- Over here…
- We can't do anything with this.

01:43:17.541 --> 01:43:20.291
- Do you have another angle?
- Did you find anything?

01:43:21.000 --> 01:43:21.875
No, sir.

01:43:22.625 --> 01:43:23.500
Look again.

01:43:24.375 --> 01:43:26.375
Have you ever done anything properly?

01:43:28.375 --> 01:43:29.666
All this is your fault.

01:43:30.833 --> 01:43:32.875
Had we given him the money he wanted

01:43:34.875 --> 01:43:36.208
we would've gotten the drive.

01:43:36.791 --> 01:43:39.125
What if he doesn't hand over the drive
after taking the money?

01:43:39.500 --> 01:43:41.291
What would you do then? Think.

01:43:47.625 --> 01:43:49.416
<i>Annayya,</i> I saw Sarangi.

01:43:50.750 --> 01:43:51.875
I saw her too.

01:43:53.333 --> 01:43:56.333
I think Sarangi was with him, <i>Annayya.</i>

01:43:57.708 --> 01:43:59.958
There were three other cameras.
What about them?

01:44:00.250 --> 01:44:01.166
I saw her too.

01:44:01.500 --> 01:44:03.250
But it wasn't him.
It was someone else.

01:44:06.500 --> 01:44:07.666
Something's not right.

01:44:08.208 --> 01:44:09.291
She was scared

01:44:10.166 --> 01:44:11.208
when she saw me.

01:44:11.625 --> 01:44:13.875
Someone here is keeping her informed.

01:44:15.500 --> 01:44:17.125
Keep an eye on him, just in case.

01:44:20.750 --> 01:44:22.458
Five hundred. Thousand.

01:44:22.583 --> 01:44:24.791
- Two thousand.
- This doesn't require any medication.

01:44:24.875 --> 01:44:25.958
Makeup should do.

01:44:26.375 --> 01:44:29.125
Hey, I think the drone got
a clear shot of my face.

01:44:29.625 --> 01:44:31.833
If I get caught, we all go down.

01:44:32.208 --> 01:44:33.166
No compromise.

01:44:33.625 --> 01:44:35.375
Why did you take off your mask?

01:44:36.208 --> 01:44:37.458
You're going to get us into trouble!

01:44:37.708 --> 01:44:39.375
It was uncomfortable, so I took it off.

01:44:39.458 --> 01:44:42.125
- It's natural!
- Hey! Would you guys stop?

01:44:42.791 --> 01:44:44.208
The first time,
he showed up without any money.

01:44:44.708 --> 01:44:46.458
The second time, they brought the money
but refused to hand it over.

01:44:46.833 --> 01:44:47.958
Yes.

01:44:48.458 --> 01:44:50.083
Our plan wasn't a mess, Doctor.

01:44:50.583 --> 01:44:52.000
Reddy is the one who ruined it.

01:44:53.166 --> 01:44:55.166
First of all, what's the link between
Reddy and Vincent?

01:44:55.958 --> 01:44:57.791
Why does Reddy need the drive?

01:44:58.000 --> 01:45:01.416
- Can we think about that?
- You said Reddy was Vincent's man.

01:45:03.166 --> 01:45:04.166
I don't think so.

01:45:04.250 --> 01:45:07.458
When Reddy attacked us,
he never touched the money.

01:45:08.166 --> 01:45:10.333
This drive was all he could focus on.

01:45:10.791 --> 01:45:12.375
But it wasn't just him.

01:45:12.750 --> 01:45:13.916
Who else was it?

01:45:14.375 --> 01:45:15.375
Weirdo.

01:45:15.708 --> 01:45:16.875
Besides these guys,

01:45:17.000 --> 01:45:20.583
a woman in the crowd pointed a gun
at me and demanded her key.

01:45:21.208 --> 01:45:22.750
This is a huge twist.

01:45:22.916 --> 01:45:24.375
What's so special about this?

01:45:38.666 --> 01:45:41.125
By any chance,
is this the key she wanted?

01:45:41.833 --> 01:45:44.791
How did you know that
there's a key in here?

01:45:46.666 --> 01:45:48.458
When I came to meet you the first time…

01:45:49.958 --> 01:45:52.208
<i>this was separated.</i>

01:45:55.125 --> 01:45:56.666
I put it back inside.

01:45:57.166 --> 01:45:58.458
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

01:45:59.208 --> 01:46:01.875
How would I know that
you would use this to blackmail him?

01:46:01.958 --> 01:46:03.500
We just found out too!

01:46:05.208 --> 01:46:06.166
Bro.

01:46:06.416 --> 01:46:07.500
This is all that's left.

01:46:08.000 --> 01:46:09.375
Oh, is that all?

01:46:12.125 --> 01:46:13.000
Hey.

01:46:14.375 --> 01:46:15.625
I have a bad feeling about this.

01:46:18.875 --> 01:46:20.208
Just take care of me.

01:46:24.166 --> 01:46:27.333
TIRUPATTUR DISTRICT POLICE STATION

01:46:33.916 --> 01:46:34.916
Sir.

01:46:35.458 --> 01:46:37.083
- My name is Guru.
- Tell me.

01:46:37.166 --> 01:46:38.666
Retired DGP Rajesh sent me here.

01:46:39.208 --> 01:46:40.125
Why?

01:46:40.416 --> 01:46:41.708
Kotlapadi Veeraya Reddy.

01:47:03.916 --> 01:47:05.708
Your plan to kill Veeraya Reddy
in an encounter.

01:47:06.333 --> 01:47:07.666
The way he destroyed your guys.

01:47:08.416 --> 01:47:09.458
I know everything, sir.

01:47:09.541 --> 01:47:10.750
Who destroyed who?

01:47:12.041 --> 01:47:13.208
We killed him right there.

01:47:13.875 --> 01:47:16.041
The man you killed
is roaming the streets freely, sir.

01:47:16.833 --> 01:47:18.208
He almost killed us.

01:47:21.083 --> 01:47:23.250
You didn't go just to kill
Kotlapadi Veeraya Reddy.

01:47:25.041 --> 01:47:26.041
This key was important too.

01:47:26.708 --> 01:47:29.625
How is he linked to this key, sir?
What is this key for?

01:47:41.458 --> 01:47:42.875
Reddy's entire fortune

01:47:44.083 --> 01:47:45.291
rests with that key.

01:47:47.041 --> 01:47:49.875
Riches that exceed a thousand crores
in a huge vault.

01:47:50.666 --> 01:47:52.708
That key is needed to open it.

01:47:53.208 --> 01:47:54.250
Where's that vault?

01:47:56.833 --> 01:47:58.291
We've looked everywhere.

01:47:59.708 --> 01:48:01.125
If Reddy is looking for the key,

01:48:02.916 --> 01:48:03.791
that means

01:48:04.458 --> 01:48:06.583
that vault must still contain
all his money.

01:48:08.541 --> 01:48:10.416
He won't rest until he finds it.

01:48:14.291 --> 01:48:15.541
If you help me out with this,

01:48:16.166 --> 01:48:17.250
I'll give you whatever you want.

01:48:18.875 --> 01:48:21.541
I've lost a lot trying to find it.

01:48:22.541 --> 01:48:23.541
A lot of people.

01:48:25.625 --> 01:48:26.583
You can leave now.

01:48:32.250 --> 01:48:33.250
Thank you, sir.

01:48:34.458 --> 01:48:35.458
Stop looking.

01:48:36.666 --> 01:48:38.708
You might end up losing a lot
in your search for it.

01:48:39.583 --> 01:48:40.500
Don't.

