<i>You still won't cool me down</i>

01:49:46.083 --> 01:49:48.833
<i>Play all your games,</i>
<i>You still can't wear me out</i>

01:49:48.958 --> 01:49:51.875
<i>I'm an endless flame,</i>
<i>A fire no one can tame</i>

01:49:51.958 --> 01:49:55.416
